ión de usuarios y estrategia","Envío y entrega de productos","Integración con Claude Code"],"fr":["86 compétences de gestion de produits","Développement de logiciels pour les Agents d''IA","Recherche d''utilisateurs et stratégie","Expédition et livraison de produits","Intégration avec Claude Code"],"de":["86 Produktmanagement-Fähigkeiten","Softwareentwicklung für KI-Agenten","Benutzerforschung und Strategie","Versand und Auslieferung von Produkten","Integration mit Claude Code"],"pt":["86 habilidades de gerenciamento de produtos","Estratégias de contratação e pesquisa de usuários","Desenvolvimento de produtos com agentes de IA","Integração com ferramentas de desenvolvimento","Otimização de processos de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["86 навыков управления продуктами","Стратегии найма и исследования пользователей","Разработка продуктов с ИИ Агентами","Интеграция с инструментами разработки","Оптимизация процессов разработки"],"ar":["86 مهارة إدارة المنتجات","استراتيجيات التوظيف و بحث المستخدمين","تطوير المنتجات مع موكل الذكاء الاصطناعي","التكامل مع أدوات التطوير","تحسين عمليات التطوير"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Vibe-Coding是什么","AI智能代理开发工具","产品管理技能","Claude Code开发","AI智能代理开发框架","如何使用Vibe-Coding","Vibe-Coding安装","Vibe-Coding设置指南"],"ja":["Vibe-Codingとは","AIエージェント開発ツール","プロダクトマネジメントスキル","Claude Code開発","AIエージェント開発フレームワーク","Vibe-Codingの使い方","Vibe-Codingのインストール","Vibe-Codingのセットアップガイド"],"ko":["Vibe-Coding이란","AI 에이전트 개발 도구","제품 관리 스킬","Claude Code 개발","AI 에이전트 개발 프레임워크","Vibe-Coding 사용 방법","Vibe-Coding 설치","Vibe-Coding 설정 가이드"],"es":["cómo usar Agentes de IA","qué es el desarrollo de software","Agentes de IA alternativos","vibe-coding vs otros herramientas de codificación","instalación de Agentes de IA","guía de configuración de Agentes de IA","desarrollo de habilidades de codificación"],"fr":["comment utiliser les Agents d''IA","qu''est-ce que le développement de logiciels","Agents d''IA alternatifs","vibe-coding vs autres outils de codage","installation des Agents d''IA","guide de configuration des Agents d''IA","développement de compétences de codage"],"de":["wie man KI-Agenten verwendet","was ist Softwareentwicklung","KI-Agenten-Alternativen","vibe-coding vs andere Kodierwerkzeuge","Installation von KI-Agenten","Konfigurationsanleitung für KI-Agenten","Entwicklung von Kodierfähigkeiten"],"pt":["como usar vibe-coding","o que é vibe-coding","vibe-coding vs outras ferramentas","instalar vibe-coding","guia de configuração do vibe-coding","desenvolvimento de produtos com IA","ferramentas de IA para desenvolvedores","gerenciamento de produtos com IA"],"ru":["как использовать vibe-coding","что такое vibe-coding","vibe-coding vs другие инструменты","установить vibe-coding","руководство по настройке vibe-coding","разработка продуктов с ИИ","инструменты ИИ для разработчиков","управление продуктами с ИИ"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام vibe-coding","ما هو vibe-coding","vibe-coding مقابل أدوات أخرى","تثبيت vibe-coding","دليل إعداد vibe-coding","تطوير المنتجات مع الذكاء الاصطناعي","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي للمطورين","إدارة المنتجات مع الذكاء الاصطناعي"]}},"owner":"RefoundAI","repo":"lenny-skills","repoPath":"RefoundAI/lenny-skills","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:10.975Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"vibe-coding","description":"Help users build software using AI coding tools. Use when someone is using AI to generate code, building prototypes without deep technical skills, or exploring how non-engineers can create functional software through natural language.","bodyPreview":"# Vibe Coding\n\nHelp the user build software using AI tools and natural language, using frameworks and insights from 3 product leaders.\n\n## How to Help\n\nWhen the user asks for help with vibe coding:\n\n1. **Understand the goal** - Ask what they''re trying to build and who it''s for (prototype, internal tool, production app)\n2. **Guide the approach** - Help them break down the problem into smaller pieces for iterative AI prompts\n3. **Set expectations** - Discuss what vibe coding is good for (prototype","body":"# Vibe Coding\n\nHelp the user build software using AI tools and natural language, using frameworks and insights from 3 product leaders.\n\n## How to Help\n\nWhen the user asks for help with vibe coding:\n\n1. **Understand the goal** - Ask what they''re trying to build and who it''s for (prototype, internal tool, production app)\n2. **Guide the approach** - Help them break down the problem into smaller pieces for iterative AI prompts\n3. **Set expectations** - Discuss what vibe coding is good for (prototypes, MVPs) versus when professional engineering is needed\n4. **Coach on iteration** - Help them understand how to refine output through follow-up prompts\n\n## Core Principles\n\n### Vibe coding is a new skill\nElena Verna: \"I vibe code myself so I would put that as even as a skill on my resume now.\" This is a distinct, transformative skill for non-technical roles - PMs, marketers, designers - to build functional software using natural language.\n\n### Replace Figma with prototypes\nKevin Weil: \"Instead of showing stuff in Figma, we should be showing prototypes that people are vibe coding over the course of 30 minutes to illustrate proofs of concept.\" Functional code prototypes can be built in the time it takes to create static mockups.\n\n### Build tools to build tools\nAlexander Embiricos: \"They''ll vibe code an animation editor and then they use the animation editor to build the animation.\" Non-engineers can now build functional software and custom tools without deep technical mastery.\n\n### Go beyond prompt engineering\nVibe coding is not just writing prompts - it''s iteratively building functional software through conversation with AI. It requires understanding how to break problems down, test outputs, and refine through follow-up.\n\n### Know the limits\nVibe-coded software is great for prototypes, internal tools, and MVPs. Production-grade systems with complex requirements still need professional engineering review.\n\n## Questions to Help Users\n\n- \"What are you trying to build, and who will use it?\"\n- \"Is this a throwaway prototype or something that needs to scale?\"\n- \"Can you break this down into smaller pieces to build incrementally?\"\n- \"What''s the simplest version that would let you test your hypothesis?\"\n- \"Have you tried describing what''s not working and asking the AI to fix it?\"\n- \"Do you need this to be production-grade, or is it okay if it''s rough?\"\n\n## Common Mistakes to Flag\n\n- **Trying to build everything at once** - Break complex projects into smaller, iterative builds\n- **Not testing the output** - Always run and test what the AI generates; don''t assume it works\n- **Expecting production quality** - Vibe-coded apps are great for validation but may need engineering for production\n- **Unclear specifications** - The clearer your description of what you want, the better the output\n- **Giving up after one try** - Vibe coding is iterative; refine through follow-up prompts\n\n## Deep Dive\n\nFor all 3 insights from 3 guests, see `references/guest-insights.md`\n\n## Related Skills\n\n- Writing PRDs\n- Usability Testing\n- Building with LLMs\n- Shipping Products\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T02:55:02.862Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for AI Agents like Claude Code and AutoGPT needing iterative software development capabilities using natural language and frameworks","zh":"适合于像 Claude Code 和 AutoGPT 这样的 AI Agents，它们需要使用自然语言和框架进行迭代软件开发的能力","ja":"Claude Code や AutoGPT などの AI エージェントに適しており、自然言語とフレームワークを使用したイテレーティブなソフトウェア開発機能が必要です","ko":"Claude Code와 AutoGPT와 같은 AI 에이전트에게 적합하며, 자연어와 프레임워크를 사용한 반복적인 소프트웨어 개발 능력이 필요합니다","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de IA como Claude Code y AutoGPT que necesitan capacidades de desarrollo de software iterativo utilizando lenguaje natural y frameworks","fr":"Parfait pour les agents IA comme Claude Code et AutoGPT ayant besoin de capacités de développement de logiciels itératives utilisant le langage naturel et les frameworks","de":"Perfekt für KI-Agents wie Claude Code und AutoGPT, die iterative Software-Entwicklungs-Fähigkeiten unter Verwendung von natürlicher Sprache und Frameworks benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de IA como Claude Code e AutoGPT que necessitam de capacidades de desenvolvimento de software iterativo usando linguagem natural e frameworks","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов ИИ, таких как Claude Code и AutoGPT, которым необходимы итеративные возможности разработки программного обеспечения с использованием естественного языка и фреймворков","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي مثل Claude Code و AutoGPT الذين يحتاجون إلى قدرات تطوير برمجيات متكررة باستخدام اللغة الطبيعية والاطارات"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to break down complex problems into smaller pieces for iterative AI prompts, utilizing insights from product leaders to guide the approach and set expectations for prototype, internal tool, or production app development, leveraging natural language processing and AI tools","zh":"赋予代理人将复杂问题分解为较小的部分以进行迭代 AI 提示的能力，利用产品领导者的见解来指导方法并为原型、内部工具或生产应用程序开发设定期望，利用自然语言处理和 AI 工具","ja":"複雑な問題を小さな部分に分解してイテレーティブな AI 提示を行うためのエージェントをエンパワーメントし、プロダクトリーダーの洞察からアプローチを導き、プロトタイプ、内部ツール、またはプロダクションアプリの開発の期待を設定し、自然言語処理と AI ツールを利用する","ko":"에이전트가 복잡한 문제를 더 작은 부분으로 나누어 반복적인 AI 프롬프트를 사용하도록 하는 기능을 제공하며, 제품 리더의 통찰력을 사용하여 접근 방식을 안내하고 프로토 타입, 내부 도구 또는 프로덕션 애플리케이션 개발에 대한 기대를 설정하며, 자연어 처리와 AI 도구를 활용합니다","es":"Habilita a los agentes a descomponer problemas complejos en piezas más pequeñas para prompts de IA iterativos, utilizando información de líderes de productos para guiar el enfoque y establecer expectativas para el desarrollo de prototipos, herramientas internas o aplicaciones de producción, aprovechando el procesamiento de lenguaje natural y las herramientas de IA","fr":"Permet aux agents de décomposer des problèmes complexes en pièces plus petites pour des invites de IA itératives, en utilisant les informations des leaders de produits pour guider l''approche et définir les attentes pour le développement de prototypes, d''outils internes ou d''applications de production, en exploitant le traitement du langage naturel et les outils de IA","de":"Ermächtigt die Agents, komplexe Probleme in kleinere Teile für iterative KI-Prompts zu unterteilen, unter Nutzung von Erkenntnissen von Produktleitern, um den Ansatz zu leiten und Erwartungen für die Entwicklung von Prototypen, internen Tools oder Produktions-Apps zu setzen, und nutzt die Verarbeitung von natürlicher Sprache und KI-Tools","pt":"Habilita os agentes a quebrar problemas complexos em pedaços menores para prompts de IA iterativos, utilizando insights de líderes de produto para guiar a abordagem e definir expectativas para o desenvolvimento de protótipos, ferramentas internas ou aplicativos de produção, aproveitando o processamento de linguagem natural e ferramentas de IA","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью разбивать сложные проблемы на более мелкие части для итеративных запросов ИИ, используя идеи лидеров продукта для руководства подходом и установления ожиданий для разработки прототипов, внутренних инструментов или приложений для производства, используя обработку естественного языка и инструменты ИИ","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من كسر المشكلات المعقدة إلى قطع صغيرة لتحفيزات_IA المتكررة، باستخدام رؤى قادة المنتج لتوجيه النهج وتحديد التوقعات لتطوير النماذج الأولية والأدوات الداخلية أو تطبيقات الإنتاج، واستخدام معالجة اللغة الطبيعية وأدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي"},"useCases":{"en":["Guiding users through iterative AI prompt development","Breaking down complex software problems into manageable pieces","Setting expectations for vibe coding projects, such as prototypes or production apps"],"zh":["指导用户完成迭代 AI 提示开发","将复杂的软件问题分解为可管理的部分","为氛围编码项目（如原型或生产应用程序）设定期望"],"ja":["ユーザーをイテレーティブな AI 提示開発に導く","複雑なソフトウェア問題を管理可能な部分に分解する","プロトタイプまたはプロダクションアプリなどの雰囲気コーディングプロジェクトの期待を設定する"],"ko":["사용자를 반복적인 AI 프롬프트 개발을 통해 안내하는 것","복잡한 소프트웨어 문제를 관리 가능한 부분으로 나누는 것","프로토 타입 또는 프로덕션 애플리케이션과 같은 분위기 코딩 프로젝트에 대한 기대를 설정하는 것"],"es":["Guiar a los usuarios a través del desarrollo iterativo de promts de IA","Descomponer problemas de software complejos en piezas manejables","Establecer expectativas para proyectos de codificación de vibe, como prototipos o aplicaciones de producción"],"fr":["Guider les utilisateurs à travers le développement itératif d''invites de IA","Décomposer des problèmes de logiciels complexes en pièces gérables","Définir les attentes pour les projets de codage de vibe, tels que les prototypes ou les applications de production"],"de":["Benutzer durch die iterative Entwicklung von KI-Prompts führen","Komplexe Software-Probleme in handhabbare Teile unterteilen","Erwartungen für Vibe-Coding-Projekte setzen, wie z.B. Prototypen oder Produktions-Apps"],"pt":["Orientar os usuários pelo desenvolvimento iterativo de prompts de IA","Quebrar problemas de software complexos em pedaços gerenciáveis","Definir expectativas para projetos de codificação de vibe, como protótipos ou aplicativos de produção"],"ru":["Руководство пользователями в итеративном развитии запросов ИИ","Разделение сложных проблем программного обеспечения на управляемые части","Установление ожиданий для проектов кодирования настроений, таких как прототипы или приложения для производства"],"ar":["توجيه المستخدمين من خلال تطوير تحفيزات_IA المتكررة","تقسيم مشاكل البرمجيات المعقدة إلى قطع قابلة للإدارة","تحديد التوقعات لمشاريع ترميز الاهتمام، مثل النماذج الأولية أو تطبيقات الإنتاج"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires user input for goal understanding","Limited to software development using AI tools and natural language","Dependent on the quality of user research and strategy"],"zh":["需要用户输入以了解目标","仅限使用 AI 工具和自然语言进行软件开发","依赖于用户研究和策略的质量"],"ja":["目標の理解のためにユーザー入力を必要とする","AI ツールと自然言語を使用したソフトウェア開発のみに限定される","ユーザー研究と戦略の品質に依存する"],"ko":["목표를 이해하기 위해 사용자 입력이 필요함","AI 도구와 자연어를 사용한 소프트웨어 개발에만 제한됨","사용자 연구와 전략의 품질에 의존함"],"es":["Requiere la entrada del usuario para la comprensión de objetivos","Limitado al desarrollo de software utilizando herramientas de IA y lenguaje natural","Dependiente de la calidad de la investigación y la estrategia del usuario"],"fr":["Nécessite la saisie de l''utilisateur pour la compréhension des objectifs","Limité au développement de logiciels utilisant les outils de IA et le langage naturel","Dépend de la qualité de la recherche et de la stratégie de l''utilisateur"],"de":["Benutzereingabe für das Verständnis von Zielen erforderlich","Begrenzt auf die Software-Entwicklung unter Verwendung von KI-Tools und natürlicher Sprache","Abhängig von der Qualität der Benutzerforschung und -strategie"],"pt":["Exige entrada do usuário para compreensão de metas","Limitado ao desenvolvimento de software usando ferramentas de IA e linguagem natural","Dependente da qualidade da pesquisa do usuário e da estratégia"],"ru":["Требует ввода пользователя для понимания целей","Ограничен разработкой программного обеспечения с использованием инструментов ИИ и естественного языка","Зависит от качества исследования пользователя и стратегии"],"ar":["يتطلب إدخال المستخدم لفهم الأهداف","محدود بتطوير البرمجيات باستخدام أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي واللغة الطبيعية","يعتمد على جودة بحث المستخدم والاستراتيجية"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"6f00b27b99375a7925a5365cae4bb4ad1dc754ce75389a25faf8da422fe5c7a1","qualityScore":26}');
