indcss+mock 기술 스택","APP, 미니 프로그램, h5 프로젝트의 빠른 구축","路由 설정의 최적화","성능과 유지 보수성의 향상","다양한 개발 환경의 지원"],"es":["Rutas dinámicas","Rutas estáticas","Rutas con parámetros","Rutas con restricciones","Rutas con middleware"],"fr":["Routes dynamiques","Routes statiques","Routes avec des paramètres","Routes avec des restrictions","Routes avec des middleware"],"de":["Dynamische Routen","Statische Routen","Routen mit Parametern","Routen mit Einschränkungen","Routen mit Middleware"],"pt":["Integração com uniapp","Suporte a Vue 3","Uso de Vite para compilação","Gerenciamento de estado com Pinia","Estilização com Tailwind CSS"],"ru":["Интеграция с uniapp","Поддержка Vue 3","Использование Vite для компиляции","Управление состоянием с помощью Pinia","Стилизация с помощью Tailwind CSS"],"ar":["التكامل مع uniapp","دعم Vue 3","استخدام Vite للترجمة","إدارة الحالة مع Pinia","التشكيل مع Tailwind CSS"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Vue Router 最佳实践","uniapp开发","vue3开发","vite开发","pinia开发","tailwindcss开发","mock开发","APP开发","小程序开发","h5开发"],"ja":["Vue Router ベストプラクティス","uniapp開発","Vue 3開発","vite開発","pinia開発","tailwindcss開発","mock開発","APP開発","ミニプログラム開発","h5開発"],"ko":["Vue Router 최적화 가이드","uniapp 개발","vue3 개발","vite 개발","pinia 개발","tailwindcss 개발","mock 개발","APP 개발","미니 프로그램 개발","h5 개발"],"es":["vue router","rutas en vue","mejores prácticas de vue router","vue router vs react router","vue router instalación","vue router setup guide"],"fr":["vue router","routes en vue","meilleures pratiques de vue router","vue router vs react router","vue router installation","vue router setup guide"],"de":["vue router","routen in vue","beste praktiken von vue router","vue router vs react router","vue router installieren","vue router setup guide"],"pt":["vue router","uniapp","vue 3","vite","pinia","tailwind css","melhores práticas","desenvolvimento web","aplicações móveis"],"ru":["vue router","uniapp","vue 3","vite","pinia","tailwind css","лучшие практики","веб-разработка","мобильные приложения"],"ar":["vue router","uniapp","vue 3","vite","pinia","tailwind css","أفضل الممارسات","تطوير الويب","التطبيقات النقالة"]}},"owner":"zuiaizengdada","repo":"uniapp_vue3_vite_pinia_template","repoPath":"zuiaizengdada/uniapp_vue3_vite_pinia_template","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:11.010Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"vue-router-best-practices","description":"Vue Router 4 patterns, navigation guards, route params, and route-component lifecycle interactions.","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"Vue Router best practices, common gotchas, and navigation patterns.\n\n### Navigation Guards\n\n- Navigating between same route with different params → See [router-beforeenter-no-param-trigger](reference/router-beforeenter-no-param-trigger.md)\n- Accessing component instance in beforeRouteEnter guard → See [router-beforerouteenter-no-this](reference/router-beforerouteenter-no-this.md)\n- Navigation guard making API calls without awaiting → See [router-guard-async-await-pattern](reference/router-guard-","body":"Vue Router best practices, common gotchas, and navigation patterns.\n\n### Navigation Guards\n\n- Navigating between same route with different params → See [router-beforeenter-no-param-trigger](reference/router-beforeenter-no-param-trigger.md)\n- Accessing component instance in beforeRouteEnter guard → See [router-beforerouteenter-no-this](reference/router-beforerouteenter-no-this.md)\n- Navigation guard making API calls without awaiting → See [router-guard-async-await-pattern](reference/router-guard-async-await-pattern.md)\n- Users trapped in infinite redirect loops → See [router-navigation-guard-infinite-loop](reference/router-navigation-guard-infinite-loop.md)\n- Navigation guard using deprecated next() function → See [router-navigation-guard-next-deprecated](reference/router-navigation-guard-next-deprecated.md)\n\n### Route Lifecycle\n\n- Stale data when navigating between same route → See [router-param-change-no-lifecycle](reference/router-param-change-no-lifecycle.md)\n- Event listeners persisting after component unmounts → See [router-simple-routing-cleanup](reference/router-simple-routing-cleanup.md)\n\n### Setup\n\n- Building production single-page application → See [router-use-vue-router-for-production](reference/router-use-vue-router-for-production.md)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T03:08:34.189Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing advanced Vue Router navigation and guard implementation capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要高级Vue Router导航和守卫实现能力的前端代理。","ja":"フロントエンドエージェントが高度なVue Routerナビゲーションとガードの実装機能を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"고급 Vue Router 네비게이션 및 가드 구현 기능이 필요한 프런트엔드 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes Frontend que necesitan capacidades de navegación avanzadas de Vue Router y implementación de guardias.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents Frontend ayant besoin de capacités de navigation avancées de Vue Router et de mise en œuvre de gardes.","de":"Perfekt für Frontend-Agents, die erweiterte Vue Router-Navigations- und Guard-Implementierungsfunktionen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Frontend que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de navegação e implementação de guardas do Vue Router.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов Frontend, которым требуются продвинутые возможности навигации и реализации охранников Vue Router.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الأماميين الذين يحتاجون إلى قابليات متقدمة في التنقل والتنفيذ لحارس Vue Router."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to implement robust navigation guards, handle route params, and optimize navigation patterns using Vue Router''s beforeRouteEnter and beforeEnter guards, while ensuring seamless integration with Vue 3, Vite, Pinia, and Tailwind CSS.","zh":"赋予代理实现强大的导航守卫、处理路由参数和使用Vue Router的beforeRouteEnter和beforeEnter守卫优化导航模式的能力，同时确保与Vue 3、Vite、Pinia和Tailwind CSS的无缝集成。","ja":"エージェントが堅牢なナビゲーションガードを実装し、ルートパラメータを処理し、Vue RouterのbeforeRouteEnterとbeforeEnterガードを使用してナビゲーションパターンを最適化する能力を提供し、同時にVue 3、Vite、Pinia、Tailwind CSSとのシームレスな統合を保証します。","ko":"에이전트가 강력한 네비게이션 가드를 구현하고, 루트 매개 변수를 처리하며, Vue Router의 beforeRouteEnter 및 beforeEnter 가드를 사용하여 네비게이션 패턴을 최적화하는 기능을 제공함으로써, Vue 3, Vite, Pinia 및 Tailwind CSS와의無縫な統合을 보장합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a implementar guardias de navegación robustas, manejar parámetros de ruta y optimizar patrones de navegación utilizando los guardias beforeRouteEnter y beforeEnter de Vue Router, garantizando al mismo tiempo una integración fluida con Vue 3, Vite, Pinia y Tailwind CSS.","fr":"Permet aux agents de mettre en œuvre des gardes de navigation robustes, de gérer les paramètres de route et d''optimiser les modèles de navigation en utilisant les gardes beforeRouteEnter et beforeEnter de Vue Router, tout en assurant une intégration fluide avec Vue 3, Vite, Pinia et Tailwind CSS.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, robuste Navigationsgards zu implementieren, Routenparameter zu verarbeiten und Navigationsmuster mit den beforeRouteEnter- und beforeEnter-Guards von Vue Router zu optimieren, während gleichzeitig eine nahtlose Integration mit Vue 3, Vite, Pinia und Tailwind CSS gewährleistet wird.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a implementar guardas de navegação robustos, lidar com parâmetros de rota e otimizar padrões de navegação usando os guardas beforeRouteEnter e beforeEnter do Vue Router, garantindo uma integração perfeita com Vue 3, Vite, Pinia e Tailwind CSS.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью реализовать надежные навигационные охранники, обрабатывать параметры маршрута и оптимизировать навигационные модели с помощью охранников beforeRouteEnter и beforeEnter Vue Router, обеспечивая бесперебойную интеграцию с Vue 3, Vite, Pinia и Tailwind CSS.","ar":"يتمكن الوكلاء من تنفيذ حراس التنقل القوي، التعامل مع 매개 변수 الطريق، وتحسين أنماط التنقل باستخدام حراس beforeRouteEnter وbeforeEnter من Vue Router، مع ضمان التكامل السلس مع Vue 3، Vite، Pinia و Tailwind CSS."},"useCases":{"en":["Implementing navigation guards for secure route access","Handling route params in beforeRouteEnter guards","Optimizing navigation patterns for improved user experience"],"zh":["为安全路由访问实现导航守卫","在beforeRouteEnter守卫中处理路由参数","优化导航模式以提高用户体验"],"ja":["セキュアなルートアクセス用のナビゲーションガードを実装する","beforeRouteEnterガードでルートパラメータを処理する","ユーザーエクスペリエンスの向上のためのナビゲーションパターンの最適化"],"ko":["보안 ルート アクセ스 위한 네비게이션 가드 구현","beforeRouteEnter 가드에서 루트 매개 변수 처리","사용자 경험 향상을 위한 네비게이션 패턴 최적화"],"es":["Implementar guardias de navegación para el acceso seguro a rutas","Manejar parámetros de ruta en guardias beforeRouteEnter","Optimizar patrones de navegación para mejorar la experiencia del usuario"],"fr":["Mettre en œuvre des gardes de navigation pour un accès sécurisé aux routes","Gérer les paramètres de route dans les gardes beforeRouteEnter","Optimiser les modèles de navigation pour améliorer l''expérience utilisateur"],"de":["Implementierung von Navigationsgards für den sicheren Zugriff auf Routen","Verarbeiten von Routenparametern in beforeRouteEnter-Guards","Optimierung von Navigationsmustern für eine verbesserte Benutzererfahrung"],"pt":["Implementação de guardas de navegação para acesso de rota seguro","Tratamento de parâmetros de rota em guardas beforeRouteEnter","Otimização de padrões de navegação para melhorar a experiência do usuário"],"ru":["Реализация навигационных охранников для безопасного доступа к маршруту","Обработка параметров маршрута в охранниках beforeRouteEnter","Оптимизация навигационных моделей для улучшения пользовательского опыта"],"ar":["تنفيذ حراس التنقل للأمين للوصول إلى الطريق","معالجة 매개 변수 الطريق في حراس beforeRouteEnter","تحسين أنماط التنقل لتحسين تجربة المستخدم"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Vue Router and Vue 3 setup","Limited to Vue ecosystem","Needs understanding of navigation guards and route params"],"zh":["需要Vue Router和Vue 3的设置","仅限于Vue生态系统","需要对导航守卫和路由参数的理解"],"ja":["Vue RouterとVue 3の設定が必要","Vueエコシステムに限定される","ナビゲーションガードとルートパラメータの理解が必要"],"ko":["Vue Router 및 Vue 3 설정 필요","Vue 생태계에만 محدود","네비게이션 가드 및 루트 매개 변수에 대한 이해 필요"],"es":["Requiere configuración de Vue Router y Vue 3","Limitado al ecosistema de Vue","Requiere comprensión de guardias de navegación y parámetros de ruta"],"fr":["Nécessite une configuration de Vue Router et de Vue 3","Limité à l''écosystème Vue","Nécessite une compréhension des gardes de navigation et des paramètres de route"],"de":["Benötigt Vue Router- und Vue-3-Setup","Begrenzt auf das Vue-Ökosystem","Benötigt Verständnis von Navigationsgards und Routenparametern"],"pt":["Requer configuração do Vue Router e Vue 3","Limitado ao ecossistema Vue","Necessita de compreensão de guardas de navegação e parâmetros de rota"],"ru":["Требует настройки Vue Router и Vue 3","Ограничен экосистемой Vue","Требует понимания навигационных охранников и параметров маршрута"],"ar":["يتطلب إعداد Vue Router و Vue 3","محدود في نظام Vue","يحتاج إلى فهم حراس التنقل و 매개 변수 الطريق"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"7dc71662eff67889a1ab361970619a8b7a4d8d54bb01276e418124d2307db3fc","qualityScore":26}');
