"Integration mit Entwicklungstools","Detaillierte Analyseberichte"],"pt":["Análise estatística de código em Go e Python","Melhoria da qualidade do código","Detecção de problemas de desempenho","Otimização de código","Relatórios detalhados de análise"],"ru":["Статистический анализ кода на Go и Python","Улучшение качества кода","Обнаружение проблем с производительностью","Оптимизация кода","Подробные отчеты анализа"],"ar":["تحليل إحصائي للكود بلغة Go و Python","تحسين جودة الكود","اكتشاف مشاكل الأداء","تحسين الكود","تقارير تفصيلية للتحليل"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Go语言清洁架构","AI工具","统计源代码分析","代码质量","代码审查","如何使用Go语言清洁架构","Go语言清洁架构安装","Go语言清洁架构设置指南"],"ja":["Go_clean_architecture","AIエージェント","統計的源コード分析","コード品質","コードレビュー","Go_clean_architectureの使い方","Go_clean_architectureのインストール","Go_clean_architectureの設定ガイド"],"ko":["고클린 아키텍처","AI 에이전트","통계적 소스 코드 분석","코드 품질","코드 리뷰","고클린 아키텍처 사용 방법","고클린 아키텍처 설치","고클린 아키텍처 설정 가이드"],"es":["herramientas de análisis de código","go-clean-architecture","análisis estadístico de código","cómo mejorar la calidad del código","alternativas a go-clean-architecture","instalación de go-clean-architecture","guía de configuración de go-clean-architecture"],"fr":["outils d''analyse de code","go-clean-architecture","analyse statistique de code","comment améliorer la qualité du code","alternatives à go-clean-architecture","installation de go-clean-architecture","guide de configuration de go-clean-architecture"],"de":["Code-Analyse-Tools","go-clean-architecture","statistische Code-Analyse","wie man die Code-Qualität verbessert","Alternativen zu go-clean-architecture","Installation von go-clean-architecture","Konfigurationsanleitung für go-clean-architecture"],"pt":["como usar go-clean-architecture","o que é go-clean-architecture","ferramentas de análise de código","go-clean-architecture vs sonarqube","instalar go-clean-architecture","guias de configuração do go-clean-architecture"],"ru":["как использовать go-clean-architecture","что такое go-clean-architecture","инструменты анализа кода","go-clean-architecture vs sonarqube","установить go-clean-architecture","руководства по настройке go-clean-architecture"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام go-clean-architecture","ما هي أداة go-clean-architecture","أدوات تحليل الكود","go-clean-architecture مقابل sonarqube","تثبيت go-clean-architecture","دليل إعداد go-clean-architecture"]}},"owner":"zskulcsar","repo":"code-stats","repoPath":"zskulcsar/code-stats","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-26T08:25:24.757Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"go-clean-architecture","description":"Expert knowledge in Go clean architecture patterns and best practices","bodyPreview":"# Go Clean Architecture Skill\n\n## Overview\n\nClean Architecture in Go emphasizes separation of concerns through distinct layers, with dependencies pointing inward toward the domain.\n\n## Layer Structure\n\n### Domain Layer (innermost)\n**Location:** `internal/domain/`\n\n**Contains:**\n- Business entities (structs)\n- Repository interfaces\n- Domain logic and validation\n- Business rules\n\n**Rules:**\n- NO external dependencies\n- NO framework dependencies\n- Pure business logic\n- Defines contracts for outer l","body":"# Go Clean Architecture Skill\n\n## Overview\n\nClean Architecture in Go emphasizes separation of concerns through distinct layers, with dependencies pointing inward toward the domain.\n\n## Layer Structure\n\n### Domain Layer (innermost)\n**Location:** `internal/domain/`\n\n**Contains:**\n- Business entities (structs)\n- Repository interfaces\n- Domain logic and validation\n- Business rules\n\n**Rules:**\n- NO external dependencies\n- NO framework dependencies\n- Pure business logic\n- Defines contracts for outer layers\n\n**Example:**\n```go\n// internal/domain/account.go\npackage domain\n\ntype Account struct {\n    ID      string\n    Name    string\n    Type    AccountType\n    Balance int // cents\n}\n\ntype AccountRepository interface {\n    Create(account *Account) error\n    GetByID(id string) (*Account, error)\n    Update(account *Account) error\n    Delete(id string) error\n}\n\n// Domain validation\nfunc (a *Account) Validate() error {\n    if a.Name == \"\" {\n        return ErrInvalidName\n    }\n    if !a.Type.IsValid() {\n        return ErrInvalidType\n    }\n    return nil\n}\n```\n\n### Application Layer (middle)\n**Location:** `internal/application/`\n\n**Contains:**\n- Business logic services\n- Use case orchestration\n- Service interfaces\n- Cross-cutting concerns\n\n**Rules:**\n- Depends ONLY on domain interfaces\n- NO HTTP dependencies\n- NO database dependencies\n- Orchestrates domain entities\n\n**Example:**\n```go\n// internal/application/account_service.go\npackage application\n\nimport \"internal/domain\"\n\ntype AccountService struct {\n    repo domain.AccountRepository // Interface, not concrete type\n}\n\nfunc NewAccountService(repo domain.AccountRepository) *AccountService {\n    return &AccountService{repo: repo}\n}\n\nfunc (s *AccountService) CreateAccount(account *domain.Account) error {\n    if err := account.Validate(); err != nil {\n        return fmt.Errorf(\"validation failed: %w\", err)\n    }\n\n    if err := s.repo.Create(account); err != nil {\n        return fmt.Errorf(\"failed to create account: %w\", err)\n    }\n\n    return nil\n}\n```\n\n### Infrastructure Layer (outermost)\n**Location:** `internal/infrastructure/`\n\n**Contains:**\n- Repository implementations\n- HTTP handlers\n- Database logic\n- External service integrations\n\n**Rules:**\n- Implements domain interfaces\n- Can have external dependencies\n- Handlers should be thin (parse → service → respond)\n- Repositories only handle persistence\n\n**Example:**\n```go\n// internal/infrastructure/repository/account_repository.go\npackage repository\n\nimport (\n    \"database/sql\"\n    \"internal/domain\"\n)\n\ntype AccountRepository struct {\n    db *sql.DB\n}\n\nfunc NewAccountRepository(db *sql.DB) *AccountRepository {\n    return &AccountRepository{db: db}\n}\n\nfunc (r *AccountRepository) Create(account *domain.Account) error {\n    query := `INSERT INTO accounts (id, name, type, balance) VALUES (?, ?, ?, ?)`\n    _, err := r.db.Exec(query, account.ID, account.Name, account.Type, account.Balance)\n    return err\n}\n\n// internal/infrastructure/http/handlers/account_handler.go\npackage handlers\n\ntype AccountHandler struct {\n    service *application.AccountService\n}\n\nfunc (h *AccountHandler) CreateAccount(w http.ResponseWriter, r *http.Request) {\n    // 1. Parse request\n    var req CreateAccountRequest\n    if err := json.NewDecoder(r.Body).Decode(&req); err != nil {\n        http.Error(w, \"invalid request\", http.StatusBadRequest)\n        return\n    }\n\n    // 2. Call service\n    account := req.ToDomain()\n    if err := h.service.CreateAccount(account); err != nil {\n        http.Error(w, err.Error(), http.StatusInternalServerError)\n        return\n    }\n\n    // 3. Return response\n    w.WriteHeader(http.StatusCreated)\n    json.NewEncoder(w).Encode(account)\n}\n```\n\n## Dependency Injection\n\nWire dependencies in main.go:\n\n```go\n// cmd/server/main.go\nfunc main() {\n    // Infrastructure\n    db := setupDatabase()\n\n    // Repositories (concrete implementations)\n    accountRepo := repository.NewAccountRepository(db)\n\n    // Services (injected with interfaces)\n    accountService := application.NewAccountService(accountRepo)\n\n    // Handlers (injected with services)\n    accountHandler := handlers.NewAccountHandler(accountService)\n\n    // Router\n    router := setupRouter(accountHandler)\n\n    http.ListenAndServe(\":8080\", router)\n}\n```\n\n## Common Patterns\n\n### Repository Pattern\n```go\n// Domain defines interface\ntype Repository interface {\n    Create(entity *Entity) error\n    GetByID(id string) (*Entity, error)\n}\n\n// Infrastructure implements\ntype SQLRepository struct {\n    db *sql.DB\n}\n\nfunc (r *SQLRepository) Create(entity *Entity) error {\n    // SQL implementation\n}\n```\n\n### Service Pattern\n```go\ntype Service struct {\n    repo domain.Repository  // Depend on interface\n}\n\nfunc (s *Service) DoBusinessLogic(entity *domain.Entity) error {\n    // Validate\n    // Transform\n    // Call repository\n    return s.repo.Create(entity)\n}\n```\n\n### Handler Pattern\n```go\nfunc (h *Handler) HandleRequest(w http.ResponseWriter, r *http.Request) {\n    // Parse → Service → Respond\n    req := parseRequest(r)\n    result, err := h.service.Do(req)\n    respond(w, result, err)\n}\n```\n\n## Anti-Patterns to Avoid\n\n### ❌ Domain with External Dependencies\n```go\n// BAD: Domain importing database\nimport \"database/sql\"\n\ntype Account struct {\n    db *sql.DB  // ❌ Domain shouldn''t know about database\n}\n```\n\n### ❌ Service with HTTP/Database\n```go\n// BAD: Service with HTTP dependency\nfunc (s *Service) Create(w http.ResponseWriter, r *http.Request) {\n    // ❌ Service shouldn''t handle HTTP\n}\n\n// BAD: Service with database dependency\nfunc (s *Service) Create(db *sql.DB, entity *Entity) error {\n    // ❌ Service should use repository interface\n}\n```\n\n### ❌ Handler with Business Logic\n```go\n// BAD: Complex logic in handler\nfunc (h *Handler) Create(w http.ResponseWriter, r *http.Request) {\n    // Parse\n    // ❌ Complex validation\n    // ❌ Calculations\n    // ❌ Business rules\n    // Direct database access\n}\n\n// GOOD: Thin handler\nfunc (h *Handler) Create(w http.ResponseWriter, r *http.Request) {\n    req := parse(r)\n    result := h.service.Create(req)  // Service has the logic\n    respond(w, result)\n}\n```\n\n### ❌ Repository with Business Logic\n```go\n// BAD: Business rules in repository\nfunc (r *Repository) Create(account *Account) error {\n    // ❌ Business validation in repository\n    if account.Balance < 0 && account.Type != \"credit\" {\n        return errors.New(\"invalid\")\n    }\n    // Should only handle persistence\n}\n```\n\n## Testing Strategy\n\n### Domain Tests\n```go\nfunc TestAccount_Validate(t *testing.T) {\n    // Test entity validation\n    // No mocks needed\n}\n```\n\n### Service Tests (Unit)\n```go\nfunc TestService_Create(t *testing.T) {\n    mockRepo := &MockRepository{}  // Mock interface\n    service := NewService(mockRepo)\n    // Test business logic\n}\n```\n\n### Repository Tests (Integration)\n```go\nfunc TestRepository_Create(t *testing.T) {\n    db := setupTestDB()  // Real database\n    repo := NewRepository(db)\n    // Test persistence\n}\n```\n\n### Handler Tests (E2E)\n```go\nfunc TestHandler_Create(t *testing.T) {\n    mockService := &MockService{}\n    handler := NewHandler(mockService)\n    req := httptest.NewRequest(\"POST\", \"/\", body)\n    w := httptest.NewRecorder()\n    handler.Create(w, req)\n    // Test HTTP layer\n}\n```\n\n## Benefits\n\n✅ **Testability**: Easy to mock dependencies\n✅ **Maintainability**: Clear separation of concerns\n✅ **Flexibility**: Easy to swap implementations\n✅ **Independence**: Domain logic independent of frameworks\n✅ **Scalability**: Easy to add features\n\n## When to Apply\n\n- Multi-layer applications\n- Complex business logic\n- Long-lived projects\n- Team projects requiring clear boundaries\n- Applications that may change databases/frameworks\n\n## Quick Checklist\n\n- [ ] Domain has no external dependencies\n- [ ] Application uses interfaces, not concrete types\n- [ ] Handlers are thin (parse → service → respond)\n- [ ] Repositories only handle persistence\n- [ ] Dependencies point inward\n- [ ] Business logic in services, not handlers\n- [ ] Each layer has clear responsibility\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-26T11:18:43.183Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Go-based AI Agents needing robust, scalable, and maintainable software architecture.","zh":"非常适合基于 Go 的 AI Agent，需要健壮、可扩展且可维护的软件架构。","ja":"Go ベースの AI Agent で、堅牢でスケーラブル、かつ保守性の高いソフトウェアアーキテクチャを必要とする場合に理想的です。","ko":"강력하고 확장 가능하며 유지보수 가능한 소프트웨어 아키텍처가 필요한 Go 기반 AI 에이전트에 이상적입니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de IA basados en Go que necesitan una arquitectura de software robusta, escalable y mantenible.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents d''IA basés sur Go nécessitant une architecture logicielle robuste, évolutuve et maintenable.","de":"Ideal für auf Go basierende KI-Agents, die eine robuste, skalierbare und wartbare Software-Architektur benötigen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de IA baseados em Go que necessitam de uma arquitetura de software robusta, escalável e mantida.","ru":"Идеально для агентов ИИ на основе Go, требующих надежной, масштабируемой и поддерживаемой программной архитектуры.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي بناءا على Go الذين يحتاجون إلى بنية برمجية قوية ومرنة وقابلة للصيانة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to enforce separation of concerns through distinct layers, utilizing repository interfaces and domain logic, while ensuring no external dependencies in the domain layer, thus providing a pure business logic foundation using Go''s clean architecture principles.","zh":"通过使用仓库接口和领域逻辑的不同层，使 Agent 能够强制执行关注点分离，同时确保领域层中没有外部依赖，从而利用 Go 的简洁架构原则提供纯粹的业务逻辑基础。","ja":"リポジトリインターフェースとドメインロジックを用いた明確なレイヤーを通じて、関心の分離を強制することをエージェントに可能にし、ドメイン層に外部依存がないことを保証します。これにより、Go のクリーンアーキテクチャ原則を使用した純粋なビジネスロジック基盤を提供します。","ko":"별개의 레이어, 리포지토리 인터페이스 및 도메인 로직을 활용하여 관심사의 분리를 적용하도록 에이전트를 지원하며, 도메인 계층에 외부 종속성이 없음을 보장하여 Go의 클린 아키텍처 원칙을 사용하는 순수한 비즈니스 로직 기반을 제공합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a aplicar la separación de preocupaciones a través de capas distintas, utilizando interfaces de repositorio y lógica de dominio, garantizando que no haya dependencias externas en la capa de dominio, proporcionando así una base de lógica de negocio pura utilizando los principios de arquitectura limpia de Go.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''appliquer la séparation des préoccupations à travers des couches distinctes, en utilisant des interfaces de référentiel et une logique de domaine, en garantissant qu''il n''y a pas de dépendances externes dans la couche de domaine, fournissant ainsi une base de logique métier pure en utilisant les principes d''architecture propre de Go.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agenten, die Trennung von Belangen durchdistincte Schichten zu erzwingen, indem Repository-Schnittstellen und Domänenlogik verwendet werden, während sichergestellt wird, dass keine externen Abhängigkeiten in der Domänen-Schicht vorhanden sind, und somit eine reine Geschäftlogik-Basis unter Verwendung der sauberen Architekturprinzipien von Go bereitstellt.","pt":"Permite que os agentes apliquem a separação de preocupações por meio de camadas distintas, utilizando interfaces de repositório e lógica de domínio, garantindo que não haja dependências externas na camada de domínio, fornecendo assim uma base de lógica de negócios pura usando os princípios de arquitetura limpa do Go.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью обеспечить разделение проблем посредством отдельных слоев, используя интерфейсы хранилищ и доменную логику, гарантируя отсутствие внешних зависимостей в слое домена, тем самым предоставляя чистую основу бизнес-логики с использованием принципов чистой архитектуры Go.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من تطبيق فصل الاهتمامات من خلال طبقات متميزة، باستخدام واجهات للمخازن و منطق النطاق، مع ضمان عدم وجود зависимости خارجية في طبقة النطاق، و بذلك تقديم أساس منطقي تجاري نقي باستخدام مبادئ بنية Go النظيفة."},"useCases":{"en":["Implementing domain-driven design in Go applications","Enforcing separation of concerns in large-scale systems","Validating business rules and logic in Go-based projects"],"zh":["在 Go 应用程序中实现领域驱动设计","在大型系统中强制执行关注点分离","在基于 Go 的项目中验证业务规则和逻辑"],"ja":["Go アプリケーションにおけるドメイン駆動設計の実装","大規模システムにおける関心の分離の強制","Go ベースのプロジェクトにおけるビジネスルールとロジックの検証"],"ko":["Go 애플리케이션에서 도메인 주도 설계 구현","대규모 시스템에서 관심사의 분리 적용","Go 기반 프로젝트에서 비즈니스 규칙 및 로직 검증"],"es":["Implementación de diseño dirigido por dominio en aplicaciones de Go","Aplicación de la separación de preocupaciones en sistemas a gran escala","Validación de reglas y lógica de negocio en proyectos basados en Go"],"fr":["Mise en œuvre de la conception dirigée par le domaine dans les applications Go","Application de la séparation des préoccupations dans les systèmes à grande échelle","Validation des règles et de la logique commerciale dans les projets basés sur Go"],"de":["Implementierung von domänengetriebenem Design in Go-Anwendungen","Durchsetzung der Trennung von Belangen in groß angelegten Systemen","Validierung von Geschäftsregeln und -logik in auf Go basierenden Projekten"],"pt":["Implementação de design orientado a domínio em aplicações Go","Enforce de separação de preocupações em sistemas de grande escala","Validação de regras de negócios e lógica em projetos baseados em Go"],"ru":["Реализация доменно-ориентированного проектирования в приложениях Go","Внедрение разделения проблем в крупномасштабных системах","Проверка бизнес-правил и логики в проектах на основе Go"],"ar":["تنفيذ تصميم موجه للنطاق في تطبيقات Go","تطبيق فصل الاهتمامات في أنظمة كبيرة النطاق","تحقق من قواعد الأعمال و المنطق في مشاريع بناءة على Go"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires adherence to strict layer structure","No external dependencies allowed in domain layer","Go programming language only"],"zh":["需要遵守严格的层级结构","领域层不允许有外部依赖","仅限 Go 编程语言"],"ja":["厳格なレイヤー構造への準拠が必要","ドメイン層での外部依存は許可されない","Go プログラミング言語のみ"],"ko":["엄격한 계층 구조 준수 필요","도메인 계층에 외부 종속성 허용 안 됨","Go 프로그래밍 언어만 해당"],"es":["Requiere la adhesión a una estructura de capas estricta","No se permiten dependencias externas en la capa de dominio","Solo lenguaje de programación Go"],"fr":["Nécessite l''adhésion à une structure de couches stricte","Aucune dépendance externe n''est autorisée dans la couche de domaine","Seul langage de programmation Go"],"de":["Erfordert die Einhaltung einer strengen Schichtenstruktur","Keine externen Abhängigkeiten sind in der Domänen-Schicht erlaubt","Nur Go-Programmiersprache"],"pt":["Exige aderência a uma estrutura de camada estrita","Não são permitidas dependências externas na camada de domínio","Apenas linguagem de programação Go"],"ru":["Требует соблюдения строгой структуры слоев","Внешние зависимости в слое домена не допускаются","Только язык программирования Go"],"ar":["يتطلب الالتزام ببنية طبقات صارمة","لا يسمح بالاعتماديات الخارجية في طبقة النطاق","لغة برمجة Go فقط"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"f7a6a0920578a56d3d493542a24c48836b99fed6736c20db0303aa9eeafde2d5","qualityScore":25}');
