g","Kompatibilität mit verschiedenen Dokumentformaten","Flexibilität bei der Anpassung der Darstellung"],"pt":["Renderização de documentos brutos como HTML estilizados","Proxy de renderização para melhorar a experiência do usuário","Suporte a documentos em vários formatos","Integração com tecnologias como React e Node.js","Facilidade de uso e configuração","Melhoria da acessibilidade e usabilidade"],"ru":["Отрисовка сырых документов в виде стиллизованного HTML","Рендеринговый прокси для улучшения пользовательского опыта","Поддержка документов в различных форматах","Интеграция с технологиями như React и Node.js","Легкость использования и настройки","Улучшение доступности и удобства использования"],"ar":["تحويل المستندات إلى HTML مصمم","بروكسي لتحويل المستندات لتحسين تجربة المستخدم","دعم المستندات في صيغ متعددة","التكامل مع تقنيات مثل React و Node.js","سهولة الاستخدام والتهيئة","تحسين إمكانية الوصول وسهولة الاستخدام"]},"keywords":{"zh":["http-patterns教程","AI智能代理是什么","渲染代理服务","http-patterns安装","http-patterns与其他工具的比较","http-patterns替代品","如何使用http-patterns","http-patterns配置指南","http-patterns性能优化"],"ja":["http-patternsの使い方","AIエージェントとは","レンダリングプロキシサービス","http-patternsのインストール","http-patternsと他のツールの比較","http-patternsの代替","http-patternsの利用方法","http-patternsの設定ガイド","http-patternsのパフォーマンス最適化"],"ko":["http-patterns 사용법","AI 에이전트란","렌더링 프록시 서비스","http-patterns 설치","http-patterns와 다른 도구의 비교","http-patterns 대안","http-patterns 사용 방법","http-patterns 설정 가이드","http-patterns 성능 최적화"],"es":["herramientas de AI","patrones HTTP","documentos HTML","proxy de representación","cómo usar patrones HTTP","alternativas a patrones HTTP","patrones HTTP vs otros proxies","instalación de patrones HTTP","guía de configuración de patrones HTTP"],"fr":["outils d''IA","modèles HTTP","documents HTML","proxy de représentation","comment utiliser les modèles HTTP","alternatives aux modèles HTTP","modèles HTTP vs autres proxies","installation des modèles HTTP","guide de configuration des modèles HTTP"],"de":["KI-Tools","HTTP-Muster","HTML-Dokumente","Render-Proxy","wie man HTTP-Muster verwendet","Alternativen zu HTTP-Mustern","HTTP-Muster vs andere Proxies","Installation von HTTP-Mustern","Konfigurationsanleitung für HTTP-Muster"],"pt":["como usar http-patterns","o que é http-patterns","ferramentas de IA para renderização de HTML","http-patterns vs outras ferramentas","instalar http-patterns","guia de configuração do http-patterns","desenvolvimento web com http-patterns","otimização de SEO com http-patterns"],"ru":["как использовать http-patterns","что такое http-patterns","инструменты ИИ для отрисовки HTML","http-patterns vs другие инструменты","установка http-patterns","руководство по настройке http-patterns","веб-разработка с http-patterns","оптимизация SEO с http-patterns"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام http-patterns","ما هو http-patterns","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي لتحويل المستندات إلى HTML","http-patterns مقابل أدوات أخرى","تثبيت http-patterns","دليل إعداد http-patterns","تطوير الويب مع http-patterns","تحسين محركات البحث مع http-patterns"]}},"owner":"air-gapped","repo":"cooked","repoPath":"air-gapped/cooked","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:10.911Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"http-patterns","description":"HTTP handler patterns for Go 1.22+. Method routing, middleware, graceful shutdown.","bodyPreview":"# HTTP Patterns\n\nGo 1.22+ patterns and project-specific conventions for HTTP handlers.\n\n---\n\n## Go 1.22: ServeMux Method Routing\n\nNo more manual method checks. Register with HTTP verb prefix:\n\n```go\nmux := http.NewServeMux()\nmux.HandleFunc(\"GET /healthz\", healthHandler)\nmux.HandleFunc(\"GET /_cooked/{path...}\", assetHandler)\nmux.HandleFunc(\"GET /{upstream...}\", renderHandler)\n```\n\n### Path Parameters\n\n```go\nfunc renderHandler(w http.ResponseWriter, r *http.Request) {\n    upstream := r.PathValue(\"","body":"# HTTP Patterns\n\nGo 1.22+ patterns and project-specific conventions for HTTP handlers.\n\n---\n\n## Go 1.22: ServeMux Method Routing\n\nNo more manual method checks. Register with HTTP verb prefix:\n\n```go\nmux := http.NewServeMux()\nmux.HandleFunc(\"GET /healthz\", healthHandler)\nmux.HandleFunc(\"GET /_cooked/{path...}\", assetHandler)\nmux.HandleFunc(\"GET /{upstream...}\", renderHandler)\n```\n\n### Path Parameters\n\n```go\nfunc renderHandler(w http.ResponseWriter, r *http.Request) {\n    upstream := r.PathValue(\"upstream\")  // NEW in Go 1.22\n    // ...\n}\n```\n\n### Special Patterns\n\n| Pattern | Matches |\n|---------|---------|\n| `/posts/{id}` | `/posts/123` (single segment) |\n| `/files/{path...}` | `/files/a/b/c` (remainder of path) |\n| `/posts/{$}` | `/posts/` only (not `/posts` or `/posts/x`) |\n\n### Precedence\n\nMore specific wins:\n- `/healthz` beats `/{upstream...}`\n- `GET /posts/{id}` beats `/posts/{id}`\n\n**Conflicting patterns panic at registration:**\n```go\nmux.HandleFunc(\"GET /posts/{id}\", h1)\nmux.HandleFunc(\"GET /{resource}/latest\", h2)  // PANIC - both match /posts/latest\n```\n\n### Automatic 405\n\nUnmatched methods return `405 Method Not Allowed` with `Allow` header.\n\n### go.mod Requirement\n\nGo 1.22+ patterns require `go 1.22` or later in `go.mod`. Without it, patterns are treated literally (braces aren''t wildcards).\n\nSources: [Go Blog: Routing Enhancements](https://go.dev/blog/routing-enhancements), [Eli Bendersky](https://eli.thegreenplace.net/2023/better-http-server-routing-in-go-122/)\n\n---\n\n## Middleware Pattern\n\nThis project uses the standard wrapper pattern:\n\n```go\nfunc RequestLogger(next http.Handler) http.Handler {\n    return http.HandlerFunc(func(w http.ResponseWriter, r *http.Request) {\n        start := time.Now()\n        wrapped := &byteCountingWriter{ResponseWriter: w}\n        next.ServeHTTP(wrapped, r)\n        slog.Info(\"request\",\n            \"method\", r.Method,\n            \"path\", r.URL.Path,\n            \"status\", wrapped.statusCode,\n            \"bytes\", wrapped.bytes,\n            \"total_ms\", time.Since(start).Milliseconds(),\n        )\n    })\n}\n\n// Composable\nvar handler http.Handler = mux\nhandler = RequestLogger(handler)\nhandler = RecoveryMiddleware(handler)\n\nsrv := &http.Server{Handler: handler}\n```\n\n---\n\n## Request Context\n\nStore request-scoped values using typed keys:\n\n```go\n// Define typed key (prevents collisions)\ntype contextKey string\nconst loggerKey contextKey = \"logger\"\n\n// Set in middleware\nctx := context.WithValue(r.Context(), loggerKey, logger)\nnext.ServeHTTP(w, r.WithContext(ctx))\n\n// Retrieve in handlers\nfunc Logger(ctx context.Context) *slog.Logger {\n    if l, ok := ctx.Value(loggerKey).(*slog.Logger); ok {\n        return l\n    }\n    return slog.Default()\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n## ResponseWriter Wrapping\n\nWrap to capture bytes and status:\n\n```go\ntype byteCountingWriter struct {\n    http.ResponseWriter\n    bytes      int64\n    statusCode int\n}\n\nfunc (w *byteCountingWriter) WriteHeader(code int) {\n    w.statusCode = code\n    w.ResponseWriter.WriteHeader(code)\n}\n\nfunc (w *byteCountingWriter) Write(b []byte) (int, error) {\n    if w.statusCode == 0 {\n        w.statusCode = 200  // Default if WriteHeader not called\n    }\n    n, err := w.ResponseWriter.Write(b)\n    w.bytes += int64(n)\n    return n, err\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n## Graceful Shutdown\n\n### Standard Pattern\n\n```go\nsrv := &http.Server{\n    Addr:    \":8080\",\n    Handler: mux,\n}\n\n// Start server\ngo func() {\n    if err := srv.ListenAndServe(); !errors.Is(err, http.ErrServerClosed) {\n        log.Fatal(err)\n    }\n}()\n\n// Wait for signal\n<-ctx.Done()\n\n// Graceful shutdown with timeout\nshutdownCtx, cancel := context.WithTimeout(context.Background(), 30*time.Second)\ndefer cancel()\n\nif err := srv.Shutdown(shutdownCtx); err != nil {\n    log.Printf(\"shutdown error: %v\", err)\n}\n```\n\n### What Shutdown() Does\n\n1. Stops accepting new connections immediately\n2. Closes idle connections\n3. Waits for active requests to complete\n4. Returns when all handlers finish OR context expires\n\n### Kubernetes Considerations\n\nAdd a health endpoint that fails during shutdown:\n\n```go\nhealthService.MarkShuttingDown()  // Called before Shutdown()\n// Readiness probe now returns 503\n```\n\nSources: [VictoriaMetrics](https://victoriametrics.com/blog/go-graceful-shutdown/), [DEV Community](https://dev.to/mokiat/proper-http-shutdown-in-go-3fji)\n\n---\n\n## Error Responses\n\ncooked returns HTML error pages, not JSON:\n\n```go\nfunc renderError(w http.ResponseWriter, r *http.Request, status int, errType, message string) {\n    w.Header().Set(\"Content-Type\", \"text/html; charset=utf-8\")\n    w.WriteHeader(status)\n    // Render error template with same theming as content pages\n}\n```\n\nError pages use the same HTML template with:\n- Proper theming (respects user''s theme choice)\n- `#cooked-error` element with `data-error-type` and `data-status-code`\n- Direct link to the upstream URL\n\n---\n\n## Handler Naming\n\n| Pattern | Returns | Example |\n|---------|---------|---------|\n| `FeatureHandler(deps)` | `http.HandlerFunc` | `RenderHandler(deps)` |\n| `FeatureMiddleware(next)` | `http.Handler` | `RequestLogger(next)` |\n\n---\n\n## What NOT to Do\n\n| Don''t | Why |\n|-------|-----|\n| Check method with `if r.Method != \"GET\"` | Use Go 1.22+ method routing |\n| Call `w.Write` after handler returns | Causes panic or writes to wrong response |\n| Use `string` context keys | Collisions — use typed keys |\n| Ignore `http.ErrServerClosed` | It''s expected from `Shutdown()` |\n| Release resources before shutdown completes | Handlers may still be using them |\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T02:21:35.706Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Go-based AI Agents needing advanced HTTP handler routing and path parameter handling.","zh":"适用于需要高级 HTTP 处理程序路由和路径参数处理的 Go 基础 AI 代理。","ja":"Go ベースの AI エージェントが高度な HTTP ハンドラー ルーティングとパス パラメータ ハンドリングを必要とする場合に適しています。","ko":"고급 HTTP 핸들러 라우팅 및 경로 매개변수 처리가 필요한 Go 기반 AI 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de inteligencia artificial basados en Go que necesitan enrutamiento de controladores HTTP avanzado y manejo de parámetros de ruta.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''intelligence artificielle basés sur Go nécessitant un routage de gestionnaire HTTP avancé et un traitement de paramètres de chemin.","de":"Perfekt für auf Go basierende KI-Agents, die erweitertes HTTP-Handler-Routing und Pfadparameter-Handling benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de IA baseados em Go que necessitam de roteamento avançado de tratamento de HTTP e tratamento de parâmetros de caminho.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов ИИ на основе Go, которым требуется продвинутая маршрутизация обработки HTTP и обработка параметров пути.","ar":"مثالي لعميل الذكاء الاصطناعي المبني على Go الذي يحتاج إلى маршーティング متقدم لمعالجة HTTP ومعالجة معاملات المسار."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to efficiently route HTTP requests using Go 1.22''s ServeMux method routing and handle path parameters with precision, leveraging HTTP verb prefix registration and raw document rendering as styled HTML.","zh":"赋予代理使用 Go 1.22 的 ServeMux 方法路由高效地路由 HTTP 请求，并使用 HTTP 动词前缀注册和原始文档渲染作为样式 HTML 处理路径参数。","ja":"Go 1.22 の ServeMux メソッド ルーティングを使用して HTTP リクエストを効率的にルーティングし、HTTP 動詞 Prefix 登録と生のドキュメントのレンダリングを使用してスタイル HTML でパス パラメータを処理することでエージェントを強化します。","ko":"Go 1.22의 ServeMux 메서드 라우팅을 사용하여 HTTP 요청을 효율적으로 라우팅하고 HTTP 동사 접두사 등록 및 원시 문서 렌더링을 사용하여 스타일 HTML로 경로 매개변수를 처리하여 에이전트를 강화합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a enrutar eficientemente las solicitudes HTTP utilizando el método de enrutamiento ServeMux de Go 1.22 y manejar parámetros de ruta con precisión, aprovechando el registro de prefijo de verbo HTTP y la representación de documentos raw como HTML estilizado.","fr":"Permet aux agents de router efficacement les requêtes HTTP en utilisant la méthode de routage ServeMux de Go 1.22 et de gérer les paramètres de chemin avec précision, en exploitant l''enregistrement de préfixe de verbe HTTP et le rendu de documents bruts sous forme de HTML stylisé.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, HTTP-Anfragen effizient mithilfe der ServeMux-Methodik von Go 1.22 zu routen und Pfadparameter präzise zu handhaben, indem es die Registrierung von HTTP-Verb-Präfixen und die Darstellung von Rohdokumenten als gestyltes HTML nutzt.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a rotear eficientemente solicitações HTTP usando o método de roteamento ServeMux do Go 1.22 e lidar com parâmetros de caminho com precisão, aproveitando o registro de prefixo de verbo HTTP e renderização de documentos brutos como HTML estilizado.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью эффективно маршрутизировать HTTP-запросы с помощью метода ServeMux в Go 1.22 и обрабатывать параметры пути с точностью, используя регистрацию префиксов HTTP-глагола и отображение необработанных документов в виде стилизованного HTML.","ar":"يمكن للوكلاء التوجيه بكفاءة لطلبات HTTP باستخدام طريقة ServeMux في Go 1.22 ومعالجة معاملات المسار بدقة، واستخدام تسجيل بادئة فعل HTTP وتفصيل المستندات الخام كHTML منمقة."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating HTTP request routing with ServeMux","Generating styled HTML from raw documents","Debugging path parameter handling in Go-based HTTP handlers"],"zh":["使用 ServeMux 自动化 HTTP 请求路由","从原始文档生成样式 HTML","调试 Go 基础 HTTP 处理程序中的路径参数处理"],"ja":["ServeMux を使用して HTTP リクエスト ルーティングを自動化する","生のドキュメントからスタイル HTML を生成する","Go ベースの HTTP ハンドラーのパス パラメータ ハンドリングのデバッグ"],"ko":["ServeMux를 사용하여 HTTP 요청 라우팅을 자동화하는 것","원시 문서에서 스타일 HTML을 생성하는 것","Go 기반 HTTP 핸들러의 경로 매개변수 처리를 디버깅하는 것"],"es":["Automatizar el enrutamiento de solicitudes HTTP con ServeMux","Generar HTML estilizado a partir de documentos raw","Depurar el manejo de parámetros de ruta en controladores HTTP basados en Go"],"fr":["Automatiser le routage des requêtes HTTP avec ServeMux","Générer du HTML stylisé à partir de documents bruts","Déboguer le traitement des paramètres de chemin dans les gestionnaires HTTP basés sur Go"],"de":["Automatisieren des Routings von HTTP-Anfragen mit ServeMux","Generieren von gestyltem HTML aus Rohdokumenten","Debuggen der Pfadparameter-Verarbeitung in Go-basierten HTTP-Handlern"],"pt":["Automatizar o roteamento de solicitações HTTP com ServeMux","Gerar HTML estilizado a partir de documentos brutos","Depurar o tratamento de parâmetros de caminho em tratadores de HTTP baseados em Go"],"ru":["Автоматизировать маршрутизацию HTTP-запросов с помощью ServeMux","Генерировать стилизованный HTML из необработанных документов","Отлаживать обработку параметров пути в обработчиках HTTP на основе Go"],"ar":["توفير توجيه لطلبات HTTP تلقائي مع ServeMux","توليد HTML منمقة من المستندات الخام","تصحيح معالجة معاملات المسار في معالجات HTTP المبنية على Go"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Go 1.22 or later","Specific to HTTP handlers and ServeMux"],"zh":["需要 Go 1.22 或更高版本","特定于 HTTP 处理程序和 ServeMux"],"ja":["Go 1.22 以降が必要","HTTP ハンドラーと ServeMux に特有"],"ko":["Go 1.22 이상이 필요함","HTTP 핸들러 및 ServeMux에 특정"],"es":["Requiere Go 1.22 o posterior","Específico para controladores HTTP y ServeMux"],"fr":["Nécessite Go 1.22 ou ultérieur","Spécifique aux gestionnaires HTTP et ServeMux"],"de":["Benötigt Go 1.22 oder höher","Spezifisch für HTTP-Handler und ServeMux"],"pt":["Requer Go 1.22 ou posterior","Específico para tratadores de HTTP e ServeMux"],"ru":["Требуется Go 1.22 или позже","Относится конкретно к обработчикам HTTP и ServeMux"],"ar":["يتطلب Go 1.22 أو إصدار أحدث","محدد لمعالجات HTTP و ServeMux"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"c934f0a24da0aee5b7c1ca9e234170fc024155699bb96e62451f979d9badde27","qualityScore":25}');
