x","Documentación detallada y ejemplos de código","Soporte técnico y comunidad de desarrolladores"],"fr":["Intégration avec l''API de RAND Forecasting Initiative","Prévisions précises avec des algorithmes d''apprentissage automatique","Compatibilité avec Python 3.x","Documentation détaillée et exemples de code","Support technique et communauté de développeurs"],"de":["Integration mit der API von RAND Forecasting Initiative","Genauige Vorhersagen mit Algorithmen des maschinellen Lernens","Kompatibilität mit Python 3.x","Detaillierte Dokumentation und Codebeispiele","Technischer Support und Entwickler-Community"],"pt":["Integração com a API da RAND Forecasting Initiative","Desenvolvimento de aplicações de previsão com ferramentas de IA","Suporte a Python para criação de scripts personalizados","Análise de dados para melhorar a precisão das previsões","Documentação completa para facilitar a implementação"],"ru":["Интеграция с API ИИ Агентов RAND Forecasting Initiative","Разработка прогнозных приложений с инструментами ИИ","Поддержка Python для создания пользовательских скриптов","Анализ данных для улучшения точности прогнозов","Полная документация для облегчения реализации"],"ar":["التكامل مع برنامج RAND للتوقعات","إنشاء تطبيقات للتنبؤ باستخدام أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","دعم بايثون لإنشاء البرامج النصية المخصصة","تحليل البيانات لتحسين دقة التوقعات","وثائق شاملة لتسهيل التنفيذ"]},"keywords":{"zh":["RAND 预测初始化 API","AI智能代理","Python SDK","如何使用RAND 预测初始化 API","RAND 预测初始化 API替代品","RAND 预测初始化 API安装","RAND 预测初始化 API设置指南"],"ja":["RAND Forecasting Initiative API","AIエージェント","Python SDK","RAND Forecasting Initiative APIの使い方","RAND Forecasting Initiative APIの代替","RAND Forecasting Initiative APIのインストール","RAND Forecasting Initiative APIの設定ガイド"],"ko":["RAND 예측 초기화 API","AI 에이전트","Python SDK","RAND 예측 초기화 API 사용법","RAND 예측 초기화 API 대체","RAND 예측 초기화 API 설치","RAND 예측 초기화 API 설정 가이드"],"es":["herramientas de AI","SDK de Python","RAND Forecasting Initiative","cómo usar el SDK de Python","qué es el SDK de Python","alternativas al SDK de Python","instalación del SDK de Python","guía de configuración del SDK de Python"],"fr":["outils d''IA","SDK Python","RAND Forecasting Initiative","comment utiliser le SDK Python","qu''est-ce que le SDK Python","alternatives au SDK Python","installation du SDK Python","guide de configuration du SDK Python"],"de":["KI-Tools","Python-SDK","RAND Forecasting Initiative","wie man das Python-SDK verwendet","was ist das Python-SDK","Alternativen zum Python-SDK","Installation des Python-SDK","Konfigurationsanleitung für das Python-SDK"],"pt":["rfi","RAND Forecasting Initiative","ferramentas de IA","previsão em Python","como usar rfi","rfi vs outras ferramentas","instalar rfi","guia de configuração do rfi"],"ru":["rfi","RAND Forecasting Initiative","ИИ Агенты","прогнозирование на Python","как использовать rfi","rfi против других инструментов","установить rfi","руководство по настройке rfi"],"ar":["rfi","مبادرة RAND للتوقعات","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","التنبؤ باللغة بايثون","كيفية استخدام rfi","rfi مقابل أدوات أخرى","تثبيت rfi","دليل إعداد rfi"]}},"owner":"chestnutforty","repo":"sdk-rfi","repoPath":"chestnutforty/sdk-rfi","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:11.152Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"rfi","description":"Crowdsourced forecasting questions and predictions from the RAND Forecasting","bodyPreview":"# RAND Forecasting Initiative (RFI)\n\nSDK that provides access to the RAND Forecasting Initiative crowdsourced forecasting platform (formerly INFER, powered by Cultivate Labs). It covers policy-relevant forecasting questions with aggregated crowd probabilities and individual forecaster predictions with rationales.\n\n## Quick Start\n\n```python\nfrom sdk_rfi import Client\n\nclient = Client()  # Uses RFI_EMAIL and RFI_PASSWORD env vars\n```\n\n## Key Methods\n\n| Method | What it does |\n|--------|-----------","body":"# RAND Forecasting Initiative (RFI)\n\nSDK that provides access to the RAND Forecasting Initiative crowdsourced forecasting platform (formerly INFER, powered by Cultivate Labs). It covers policy-relevant forecasting questions with aggregated crowd probabilities and individual forecaster predictions with rationales.\n\n## Quick Start\n\n```python\nfrom sdk_rfi import Client\n\nclient = Client()  # Uses RFI_EMAIL and RFI_PASSWORD env vars\n```\n\n## Key Methods\n\n| Method | What it does |\n|--------|-------------|\n| `client.questions.list(...)` | List forecasting questions with filtering by status, tags, challenges, date ranges |\n| `client.questions.get(question_id)` | Get a specific question with answers and crowd probabilities |\n| `client.prediction_sets.list(question_id=...)` | Get individual forecaster predictions with rationales for a question |\n| `client.comments.list(commentable_id=..., commentable_type=...)` | Get discussion comments on a question |\n\n## Data Coverage\n\n- **Domain**: Politics / policy forecasting\n- **Countries/Regions**: Global (US policy focus)\n- **Time range**: Questions from ~2020 to present\n- **Update frequency**: Event-driven (new questions published, forecasts updated continuously)\n- **Key data**: Forecasting questions on geopolitics, national security, science/technology policy, economics, biosecurity, nuclear risk, AI governance\n\n## Forecasting Patterns\n\n- **Crowd forecast as base rate**: Use `client.questions.list()` to find questions matching your topic, then read the crowd probability from `question.answers[i].probability` as a calibrated starting point.\n- **Trend analysis via prediction history**: Use `client.prediction_sets.list(question_id=X)` to see how individual forecasts changed over time. Plot `created_at` vs `forecasted_probability` to detect momentum.\n- **Expert rationale mining**: Individual prediction sets include `rationale` text explaining the forecaster''s reasoning. Use `client.prediction_sets.list(question_id=X)` and examine rationales for weak signals and arguments.\n- **Cross-reference with resolution**: Use `client.questions.list(status=\"closed\")` to find resolved questions. Compare crowd probability at various cutoff dates against actual outcomes to measure calibration.\n- **Comment-based signal detection**: Use `client.comments.list(commentable_id=X, commentable_type=\"Forecast::Question\")` to find discussion threads that may contain links to evidence or emerging developments.\n\n## Common Queries\n\n```python\n# Get all active forecasting questions\nquestions = client.questions.list()\nfor q in questions.questions:\n    print(f\"{q.id}: {q.name}\")\n    for a in (q.answers or []):\n        print(f\"  {a.name}: {a.probability_formatted}\")\n\n# Get individual forecasts and rationales for a question\nforecasts = client.prediction_sets.list(question_id=1234)\nfor ps in forecasts.prediction_sets:\n    print(f\"{ps.membership_username}: {ps.rationale}\")\n    for pred in (ps.predictions or []):\n        print(f\"  Answer {pred.answer_id}: {pred.forecasted_probability:.1%}\")\n\n# Backtest: get data as it was available on a past date\npast_questions = client.questions.list(cutoff_date=\"2025-06-01\")\npast_forecasts = client.prediction_sets.list(question_id=1234, cutoff_date=\"2025-06-01\")\n```\n\n## Full Method Reference\n\nSee `references/methods.md` for all 4 methods with complete parameter details.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T03:46:44.924Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Data Analysis Agents needing access to crowdsourced forecasting data from the RAND Forecasting Initiative API","zh":"适合需要访问RAND预测倡议API的众包预测数据的数据分析代理","ja":"RANDフォーキャスティングイニシアチブAPIからのクラウドソーシング予測データへのアクセスを必要とするデータ分析エージェントに最適","ko":"RAND 예측 이니셔티브 API로부터의 크라우드소싱 예측 데이터에 액세스가 필요한 데이터 분석 에이전트에 적합","es":"Perfecto para agentes de Análisis de Datos que necesitan acceso a datos de previsión crowdsourced de la API de la Iniciativa de Previsión RAND","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''analyse de données ayant besoin d''accéder à des données de prévision crowdsourced de l''API de l''Initiative de prévision RAND","de":"Perfekt für Data-Analytics-Agents, die Zugriff auf crowdsourced Vorhersagedaten der RAND-Vorhersage-Initiative-API benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Análise de Dados que precisam acessar dados de previsão de crowdsourced do API do RAND Forecasting Initiative","ru":"Идеально для Agentов анализа данных, которым требуется доступ к данным прогнозирования из API RAND Forecasting Initiative","ar":"ملاءق جداً للوكلاء الذين يحتاجون إلى الوصول إلى البيانات التي تم توقعها من قبل API Initiative Forecasting RAND"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to leverage the RAND Forecasting Initiative crowdsourced forecasting platform, accessing aggregated crowd probabilities and individual forecaster predictions with rationales through the Python SDK, utilizing environment variables like RFI_EMAIL and RFI_PASSWORD","zh":"赋予代理使用RAND预测倡议的众包预测平台的能力，通过Python SDK访问聚合的群体概率和个体预测者的预测及其理由，利用像RFI_EMAIL和RFI_PASSWORD这样的环境变量","ja":"RANDフォーキャスティングイニシアチブのクラウドソーシング予測プラットフォームを利用するエージェントをEmpowerし、Python SDKを通じて集計されたクラウドの確率と個々の予測者の予測とその理由をアクセスし、RFI_EMAILやRFI_PASSWORDなどの環境変数を利用する","ko":"RAND 예측 이니셔티브의 크라우드소싱 예측 플랫폼을 활용할 수 있도록 에이전트를 Empower하고, Python SDK를 통해 집계된 크라우드 확률과 개별 예측자의 예측 및 그 이유를 액세스하며, RFI_EMAIL 및 RFI_PASSWORD와 같은 환경 변수를 활용","es":"Habilita a los agentes a aprovechar la plataforma de previsión crowdsourced de la Iniciativa de Previsión RAND, accediendo a probabilidades agregadas de la multitud y predicciones individuales de los previsores con razonamientos a través del SDK de Python, utilizando variables de entorno como RFI_EMAIL y RFI_PASSWORD","fr":"Permet aux agents d''exploiter la plateforme de prévision crowdsourced de l''Initiative de prévision RAND, en accédant aux probabilités agrégées de la foule et aux prédictions individuelles des prévisionnistes avec des raisonnements via le SDK Python, en utilisant des variables d''environnement comme RFI_EMAIL et RFI_PASSWORD","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, die crowdsourced Vorhersage-Plattform der RAND-Vorhersage-Initiative zu nutzen, indem sie auf aggregierte Crowd-Wahrscheinlichkeiten und individuelle Vorhersagen der Vorhersager mit Begründungen über das Python-SDK zugreifen, wobei Umgebungsvariablen wie RFI_EMAIL und RFI_PASSWORD verwendet werden","pt":"Empodera os agentes a utilizar a plataforma de previsão de crowdsourced do RAND Forecasting Initiative, acessando probabilidades agregadas de multidão e previsões individuais de previsores com justificativas através do SDK do Python, utilizando variáveis de ambiente como RFI_EMAIL e RFI_PASSWORD","ru":"Позволяет агентам использовать платформу прогнозирования из API RAND Forecasting Initiative, доступ к агрегированным вероятностям и индивидуальным прогнозам с обоснованиями через SDK Python, используя переменные окружения как RFI_EMAIL и RFI_PASSWORD","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء استخدام منصة توقع الحشود من API Initiative Forecasting RAND, الوصول إلى احتمالات جماعية و توقعات فردية مع تبريرات من خلال SDK Python, استخدام متغيرات بيئة مثل RFI_EMAIL و RFI_PASSWORD"},"useCases":{"en":["Retrieving policy-relevant forecasting questions","Analyzing crowd probabilities for predictive modeling","Extracting individual forecaster predictions with rationales for deeper insight"],"zh":["检索与政策相关的预测问题","分析群体概率以进行预测建模","提取个体预测者的预测及其理由以获得更深入的洞察"],"ja":["政策に関連する予測の質問を取得する","予測モデリングのためのクラウドの確率を分析する","個々の予測者の予測とその理由を取得してより深い洞察を得る"],"ko":["정책 관련 예측 질문 검색","예측 모델링을 위한 크라우드 확률 분석","개별 예측자의 예측 및 그 이유를 추출하여 더 깊은 통찰력 얻기"],"es":["Recuperar preguntas de previsión relevantes para las políticas","Analizar probabilidades de la multitud para la modelización predictiva","Extraer predicciones individuales de los previsores con razonamientos para una visión más profunda"],"fr":["Récupérer des questions de prévision pertinentes pour les politiques","Analyser les probabilités de la foule pour la modélisation prédictive","Extraire des prédictions individuelles des prévisionnistes avec des raisonnements pour une vue plus approfondie"],"de":["Abrufen von politikrelevanten Vorhersagefragen","Analysieren von Crowd-Wahrscheinlichkeiten für die Vorhersagemodellierung","Extrahieren von individuellen Vorhersagen der Vorhersager mit Begründungen für einen tieferen Einblick"],"pt":["Retrieving perguntas de previsão relevantes à política","Analyzing probabilidades de multidão para modelagem preditiva","Extracting previsões individuais de previsores com justificativas para uma compreensão mais profunda"],"ru":["Retrieving perguntas de previsão relevantes à política","Analyzing probabilidades de multidão para modelagem preditiva","Extracting previsões individuais de previsores com justificativas para uma compreensão mais profunda"],"ar":["استرجاع أسئلة توقع ذات صلة بالسياسة","تحليل احتمالات جماعية لنمذج preditiva","استخراج توقعات فردية من قبل previsores مع تبريرات ل深ائق فهم"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires RFI_EMAIL and RFI_PASSWORD environment variables","Dependent on RAND Forecasting Initiative API availability"],"zh":["需要RFI_EMAIL和RFI_PASSWORD环境变量","依赖于RAND预测倡议API的可用性"],"ja":["RFI_EMAILとRFI_PASSWORD環境変数が必要","RANDフォーキャスティングイニシアチブAPIの可用性に依存"],"ko":["RFI_EMAIL 및 RFI_PASSWORD 환경 변수가 필요","RAND 예측 이니셔티브 API의 가용성에 의존"],"es":["Requiere variables de entorno RFI_EMAIL y RFI_PASSWORD","Dependiente de la disponibilidad de la API de la Iniciativa de Previsión RAND"],"fr":["Nécessite des variables d''environnement RFI_EMAIL et RFI_PASSWORD","Dépend de la disponibilité de l''API de l''Initiative de prévision RAND"],"de":["Erfordert Umgebungsvariablen RFI_EMAIL und RFI_PASSWORD","Abhängig von der Verfügbarkeit der RAND-Vorhersage-Initiative-API"],"pt":["Requer RFI_EMAIL e RFI_PASSWORD como variáveis de ambiente","Depende da disponibilidade do API do RAND Forecasting Initiative"],"ru":["Требует RFI_EMAIL и RFI_PASSWORD как переменные окружения","Зависит от доступности API RAND Forecasting Initiative"],"ar":["يتطلب RFI_EMAIL و RFI_PASSWORD كمتغيرات بيئة","يعتمد على توفر API Initiative Forecasting RAND"]},"version":3},