성을 높여줍니다","es":"Nuestro Agente de Crecimiento Personal es una herramienta de Inteligencia Artificial diseñada para ayudarte a generar ideas y mejorar tu productividad","fr":"Notre Agent de Croissance Personnelle est un outil d''Intelligence Artificielle conçu pour vous aider à générer des idées et améliorer votre productivité","de":"Unser Selbstwachstums-KI-Agent ist ein KI-Tool, das Ihnen hilft, Ideen zu generieren und Ihre Produktivität zu steigern","pt":"Os agentes de inteligência artificial são ferramentas poderosas para o crescimento pessoal e profissional","ru":"ИИ агенты являются мощными инструментами для саморазвития и карьеры","ar":"وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي هم أدوات قوية للنمو الشخصي والمهني","en":"A Self-Growth AI Agent"},"definition":{"en":"A Self-Growth AI Agent"},"features":{"zh":["利用AI算法进行创意脑暴","提高开发效率和创造力","支持多种开发语言和框架","提供实时反馈和建议","集成GitHub和其他开发工具"],"ja":["AIアルゴリズムを使用してアイデアを生み出す","開発効率と創造性を向上させる","複数の開発言語とフレームワークをサポート","リアルタイムのフィードバックと提案を提供","GitHubなどの開発ツールと連携"],"ko":["AI 알고리즘을 사용하여 아이디어를 생성","개발 효율과 창의성을 향상","다수의 개발 언어와 프레임워크를 지원","실시간 피드백과 제안을 제공","GitHub 등의 개발 도구와 통합"],"es":["Generación de ideas con Inteligencia Artificial","Análisis de tendencias y patrones","Mejora de la productividad y creatividad","Integración con herramientas de desarrollo como React y Node.js","Interfaz de línea de comandos (CLI) para una mayor flexibilidad"],"fr":["Génération d''idées avec l''Intelligence Artificielle","Analyse de tendances et de modèles","Amélioration de la productivité et de la créativité","Intégration avec des outils de développement comme React et Node.js","Interface de ligne de commande (CLI) pour une plus grande flexibilité"],"de":["Ideen-Generierung mit KI","Trend- und Musteranalyse","Steigerung der Produktivität und Kreativität","Integration mit Entwicklungstools wie React und Node.js","Kommandozeilen-Schnittstelle (CLI) für eine größere Flexibilität"],"pt":["Análise de dados para tomar decisões informadas","Aprendizado de máquina para melhorar a precisão","Interface de usuário para interagir com os agentes","Integração com outras ferramentas para ampliar a funcionalidade","Segurança de dados para proteger as informações sensíveis"],"ru":["Анализ данных для принятия обоснованных решений","Машинное обучение для улучшения точности","Интерфейс пользователя для взаимодействия с агентами","Интеграция с другими инструментами для расширения функциональности","Безопасность данных для защиты конфиденциальных информаций"],"ar":["تحليل البيانات لاتخاذ قرارات مست blat","تعلم الآلة لتحسين الدقة","واجهة المستخدم لتفاعل مع الوكلاء","التكامل مع أدوات أخرى لتعزيز الوظيفية","أمن البيانات لحماية المعلومات الحساسة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["如何使用AI智能体","什么是AI智能体","AI智能体替代品","AI智能体与其他工具的比较","AI智能体安装指南","AI智能体设置教程","使用AI智能体进行开发","AI智能体的优点"],"ja":["AIエージェントの使用方法","AIエージェントとは","AIエージェントの代替品","AIエージェントと他のツールの比較","AIエージェントのインストールガイド","AIエージェントの設定手順","AIエージェントを使用した開発","AIエージェントの利点"],"ko":["AI 에이전트 사용법","AI 에이전트란","AI 에이전트 대체품","AI 에이전트와 다른 도구의 비교","AI 에이전트 설치 가이드","AI 에이전트 설정 튜토리얼","AI 에이전트를 사용한 개발","AI 에이전트의 장점"],"es":["cómo usar herramientas de IA","qué es un Agente de Inteligencia Artificial","alternativas a herramientas de brainstorming","herramientas de IA vs herramientas de machine learning","instalación de herramientas de IA","guía de configuración de herramientas de IA"],"fr":["comment utiliser des outils d''IA","qu''est-ce qu''un Agent d''Intelligence Artificielle","alternatives aux outils de brainstorming","outils d''IA vs outils de machine learning","installation d''outils d''IA","guide de configuration des outils d''IA"],"de":["wie man KI-Tools verwendet","was ist ein KI-Agent","Alternativen zu Brainstorming-Tools","KI-Tools vs Machine-Learning-Tools","Installation von KI-Tools","Einrichtungsanleitung für KI-Tools"],"pt":["agentes de inteligência artificial","crescimento pessoal","desenvolvimento profissional","análise de dados","aprendizado de máquina","interface de usuário","integração com outras ferramentas","segurança de dados"],"ru":["ИИ агенты","саморазвитие","карьера","анализ данных","машинное обучение","интерфейс пользователя","интеграция с другими инструментами","безопасность данных"],"ar":["وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي","النمو الشخصي","التطوير المهني","تحليل البيانات","تعلم الآلة","واجهة المستخدم","التكامل مع أدوات أخرى","أمن البيانات"]}},"owner":"BaqiF2","repo":"Synapse-Agent","repoPath":"BaqiF2/Synapse-Agent","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:10.912Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"brainstorming","description":"You MUST use this before any creative work - creating features, building components, adding functionality, or modifying behavior. Explores user intent, requirements and design before implementation.","bodyPreview":"# Brainstorming Ideas Into Requirements\n\n## Overview\n\nHelp turn ideas into validated, testable requirement specifications through natural collaborative dialogue. The process starts by understanding user intent, explores approaches, refines design through incremental validation, and produces formal PRD and BDD acceptance documents.\n\nStart by understanding the current project context, then ask questions one at a time to refine the idea. Once the design is validated, produce a formal PRD and BDD ac","body":"# Brainstorming Ideas Into Requirements\n\n## Overview\n\nHelp turn ideas into validated, testable requirement specifications through natural collaborative dialogue. The process starts by understanding user intent, explores approaches, refines design through incremental validation, and produces formal PRD and BDD acceptance documents.\n\nStart by understanding the current project context, then ask questions one at a time to refine the idea. Once the design is validated, produce a formal PRD and BDD acceptance criteria — all before any technical implementation begins.\n\n## The Process\n\n**Understanding the idea:**\n- Check out the current project state first (files, docs, recent commits)\n- Ask questions one at a time to refine the idea\n- Prefer multiple choice questions when possible, but open-ended is fine too\n- Only one question per message - if a topic needs more exploration, break it into multiple questions\n- Focus on understanding: purpose, constraints, success criteria\n\n**Exploring approaches:**\n- Propose 2-3 different approaches with trade-offs\n- Present options conversationally with your recommendation and reasoning\n- Lead with your recommended option and explain why\n\n**Presenting the design:**\n- Once you believe you understand what you''re building, present the design\n- Break it into sections of 200-300 words\n- Ask after each section whether it looks right so far\n- Cover: architecture, components, data flow, error handling, state behavior, edge cases, testing\n- Be ready to go back and clarify if something doesn''t make sense\n\n**Validating for testability (BDD readiness check):**\n\nAfter the full design is presented and validated, run every design point through this checklist before finalizing:\n\n| Dimension | Question to verify |\n|---|---|\n| Input/Output format | Are the exact formats of inputs and outputs specified? (data types, structure, encoding) |\n| Error & exception scenarios | Is every failure mode explicitly described with its expected behavior? (not just the happy path) |\n| Boundary & priority rules | When ambiguity or conflict can arise, are the resolution rules defined? (precedence, fallback, default values) |\n| State behavior | Is it clear what state persists, what is isolated, and what resets? (sessions, variables, side effects) |\n| Verifiable granularity | Can each behavior be independently tested with concrete steps and a single expected outcome? |\n| Ambiguity check | Are there any implicit assumptions that different readers could interpret differently? |\n\n**How to use the checklist:**\n- For each design section, evaluate all 6 dimensions\n- Any dimension that fails → go back to the user with a targeted question to fill the gap\n- Do NOT silently assume defaults — if the PRD will be consumed downstream (e.g., converted to BDD test cases), ambiguity is a defect\n- Only proceed to documentation once all design points pass all 6 dimensions\n- Mark dimensions as \"N/A\" only when genuinely not applicable (e.g., stateless operations have no state behavior)\n\n## After the Design\n\n### Phase 1: PRD Specification\n\n**Goal**: Transform the validated design into a formal, testable PRD.\n\nRead `references/prd-template.md` for the document template.\n\n**Execution rules**:\n1. Write the PRD based on conversation history and the validated design\n2. Write to: `docs/requirements/YYYY-MM-DD-<topic>-prd.md`\n3. Present the PRD to the user section by section (300-500 words per section), confirming each before moving on\n4. **Cross-check**: Verify every design point is captured in the PRD — flag any gaps\n5. If gaps exist, present them to the user for resolution before proceeding\n6. Run the **BDD readiness check** (see checklist above) on every functional requirement\n7. Any dimension that fails → go back to the user with a targeted question. Do NOT silently assume defaults.\n\n### Phase 2: BDD Acceptance Documents\n\n**Goal**: Generate machine-parseable BDD acceptance criteria that map 1:1 to PRD requirements.\n\nRead `references/bdd-template.md` for the JSON schema and writing guide.\n\n**Execution rules**:\n1. Create directory: `docs/requirements/YYYY-MM-DD-<topic>-bdd/`\n2. Generate one JSON file per feature: `<feature-name>.json`\n3. Each JSON file follows the schema defined in `references/bdd-template.md`\n4. Set all `passes` and `overallPass` to `false` (not yet tested)\n5. Cover: normal flows, error flows, boundary conditions for each feature\n6. **Cross-check**: Compare every PRD functional requirement against BDD scenarios — ensure complete coverage\n7. If coverage gaps found, add missing scenarios\n8. Present the coverage mapping to the user for final validation\n\n### Phase 3: Summary Report\n\nAfter all documents are complete, present a summary to the user:\n\n1. **Design decisions** made during brainstorming (key choices and reasoning)\n2. **PRD** file path and requirement count (Must/Should/Could breakdown)\n3. **BDD** directory path, feature count, and total scenario count\n4. **Open questions** still unresolved (if any)\n5. **Coverage status**: Confirm PRD ↔ BDD alignment is complete\n\n### Continuing to Implementation (optional)\n\n- Ask: \"Ready to set up for implementation?\"\n- Use superpowers:using-git-worktrees to create isolated workspace if available\n- Use superpowers:writing-plans to create detailed implementation plan if available\n\n## Key Principles\n\n- **One question at a time** - Don''t overwhelm with multiple questions\n- **Multiple choice preferred** - Easier to answer than open-ended when possible\n- **YAGNI ruthlessly** - Remove unnecessary features from all designs\n- **Explore alternatives** - Always propose 2-3 approaches before settling\n- **Incremental validation** - Present design in sections, validate each\n- **Be flexible** - Go back and clarify when something doesn''t make sense\n- **No silent assumptions** - If ambiguous, ask; never fill in defaults\n- **Separate problem from solution** - Requirements describe WHAT, not HOW"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T02:21:40.242Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Collaborative AI Agents like Claude Code and AutoGPT needing advanced natural language processing for iterative idea refinement.","zh":"适合于像 Claude Code 和 AutoGPT 这样的协同 AI 代理，需要高级自然语言处理来进行迭代想法改进。","ja":"Claude Code や AutoGPT のような共同の AI エージェントに適しており、アイデアの反復的な洗練に高度な自然言語処理が必要です。","ko":"클라우드 코드 및 오토지피티와 같은 협업 인공지능 에이전트에 적합하며, 반복적인 아이디어 개선에 고급 자연어 처리가 필요합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de IA Colaborativos como Claude Code y AutoGPT que necesitan procesamiento avanzado de lenguaje natural para la refinación iterativa de ideas.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents d''IA collaboratifs comme Claude Code et AutoGPT ayant besoin d''un traitement avancé du langage naturel pour l''affinement itératif des idées.","de":"Ideal für kollaborative KI-Agenten wie Claude Code und AutoGPT, die erweiterte natürliche Sprachverarbeitung für die iterative Verfeinerung von Ideen benötigen.","pt":"Ideal for Collaborative AI Agents like Claude Code and AutoGPT needing advanced natural language processing for iterative idea refinement.","ru":"Ideal for Collaborative AI Agents like Claude Code and AutoGPT needing advanced natural language processing for iterative idea refinement.","ar":"Ideal for Collaborative AI Agents like Claude Code and AutoGPT needing advanced natural language processing for iterative idea refinement."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to facilitate collaborative dialogue, exploring approaches and refining designs through incremental validation, utilizing natural language processing to produce formal PRD and BDD acceptance documents, and leveraging protocols like natural collaborative dialogue.","zh":"赋予代理以促进协作对话的能力，通过增量验证来探索方法并改进设计，利用自然语言处理来生成正式的 PRD 和 BDD 验收文档，并利用诸如自然协作对话的协议。","ja":"エージェントに共同の対話を促進する能力を与え、インクリメンタル検証を通じてアプローチを探索し、デザインを洗練し、自然言語処理を使用して正式な PRD および BDD 受け入れ文書を生成し、自然な共同の対話などのプロトコルを利用します。","ko":"에이전트가 협업 대화를 촉진하는 능력을 부여하여 증분 확인을 통해 접근 방식을 탐색하고 설계를 개선하며, 자연어 처리를 사용하여 공식적인 PRD 및 BDD 승인 문서를 생성하며, 자연스러운 협업 대화와 같은 프로토콜을 활용합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a facilitar diálogos colaborativos, explorar enfoques y refinar diseños a través de validación incremental, utilizando el procesamiento de lenguaje natural para producir documentos formales de PRD y BDD de aceptación, y aprovechando protocolos como diálogo colaborativo natural.","fr":"Permet aux agents de faciliter des dialogues collaboratifs, d''explorer les approches et de raffiner les conceptions grâce à une validation incrémentale, en utilisant le traitement du langage naturel pour produire des documents formels de PRD et BDD d''acceptation, et en exploitant des protocoles tels que le dialogue collaboratif naturel.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, kollaborative Dialoge zu erleichtern, Ansätze zu erkunden und Entwürfe durch inkrementale Validierung zu verfeinern, wobei die natürliche Sprachverarbeitung zur Erstellung formaler PRD- und BDD-Akzeptanzdokumente verwendet wird und Protokolle wie natürlicher kollaborativer Dialog genutzt werden.","pt":"Empowers agents to facilitate collaborative dialogue, exploring approaches and refining designs through incremental validation, utilizing natural language processing to produce formal PRD and BDD acceptance documents, and leveraging protocols like natural collaborative dialogue.","ru":"Empowers agents to facilitate collaborative dialogue, exploring approaches and refining designs through incremental validation, utilizing natural language processing to produce formal PRD and BDD acceptance documents, and leveraging protocols like natural collaborative dialogue.","ar":"Empowers agents to facilitate collaborative dialogue, exploring approaches and refining designs through incremental validation, utilizing natural language processing to produce formal PRD and BDD acceptance documents, and leveraging protocols like natural collaborative dialogue."},"useCases":{"en":["Refining design concepts through iterative validation","Generating formal Product Requirement Documents (PRD)","Producing Behavior-Driven Development (BDD) acceptance documents"],"zh":["通过迭代验证来改进设计概念","生成正式的产品需求文档 (PRD)","生成行为驱动开发 (BDD) 验收文档"],"ja":["反復的な検証を通じてデザイン概念を洗練する","正式な製品要件文書 (PRD) を生成する","行動駆動開発 (BDD) の受け入れ文書を生成する"],"ko":["반복적인 확인을 통해 설계 개념을 개선하는こと","공식적인 제품 요구 사항 문서 (PRD) 를 생성하는 것","행동 주도 개발 (BDD) 승인 문서를 생성하는 것"],"es":["Refinar conceptos de diseño a través de validación iterativa","Generar documentos formales de requisitos de producto (PRD)","Producir documentos de aceptación de desarrollo impulsado por comportamiento (BDD)"],"fr":["Affiner les concepts de conception à travers une validation itérative","Générer des documents formels de spécifications de produit (PRD)","Produire des documents d''acceptation de développement piloté par le comportement (BDD)"],"de":["Durch iterative Validierung Designkonzepte verfeinern","Formale Produktanforderungsdokumente (PRD) generieren","Akzeptanzdokumente für verhaltensgesteuerte Entwicklung (BDD) produzieren"],"pt":["Refining design concepts through iterative validation","Generating formal Product Requirement Documents (PRD)","Producing Behavior-Driven Development (BDD) acceptance documents"],"ru":["Refining design concepts through iterative validation","Generating formal Product Requirement Documents (PRD)","Producing Behavior-Driven Development (BDD) acceptance documents"],"ar":["Refining design concepts through iterative validation","Generating formal Product Requirement Documents (PRD)","Producing Behavior-Driven Development (BDD) acceptance documents"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires understanding of user intent and project context","Limited to text-based dialogue"],"zh":["需要了解用户意图和项目上下文","仅限于基于文本的对话"],"ja":["ユーザーの意図とプロジェクトのコンテキストを理解する必要がある","テキストベースの対話のみに限定される"],"ko":["사용자의 의도와 프로젝트 컨텍스트를 이해해야 함","텍스트 기반 대화에만 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere comprensión de la intención del usuario y del contexto del proyecto","Limitado a diálogos basados en texto"],"fr":["Nécessite une compréhension de l''intention de l''utilisateur et du contexte du projet","Limité aux dialogues basés sur le texte"],"de":["Benötigt Verständnis für die Absicht des Benutzers und den Kontext des Projekts","Begrenzt auf textbasierte Dialoge"],"pt":["Requires understanding of user intent and project context","Limited to text-based dialogue"],"ru":["Requires understanding of user intent and project context","Limited to text-based dialogue"],"ar":["Requires understanding of user intent and project context","Limited to text-based dialogue"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"50f4e047c13a698922ab9433c355b64d506dd84c57d85d8bf3fa0a82ac7ff479","qualityScore":24}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('hundong2/Crawl-all-you-need/readme-i18n-sync', 'community', 'hundong2', 'Crawl-all-you-need', 'hundong2/Crawl-all-you-need', 'readme-i18n-sync', 0, 0, 24, '2026-03-02T01:56:10.970Z', '2026-03-02T02:53:23.729Z', '24ac72ba46b97759b53794659751934beee54d92c3267e3a95a8696d70e27000', '{"id":"hundong2/Crawl-all-you-need/readme-i18n-sync","name":"readme-i18n-sync","description":{"zh":"README-i18n-sync AI工具用于同步和管理全球知识，通过爬虫技术收集和整理数据","ja":"README-i18n-sync AIエージェントは、世界の知識をクロールして管理するために設計されています","ko":"README-i18n-sync AI 에이전트는 세계 지식을 크롤링하고 관리하는 데 사용됩니다","es":"readme-i18n-sync es una herramienta de AI que recopila conocimientos mundiales mediante tecnologías de crawling avanzadas","fr":"readme-i18n-sync est un outil d''IA qui rassemble les connaissances mondiales grâce à des technologies de crawling de pointe","de":"readme-i18n-sync ist ein KI-Tool, das weltweites Wissen mithilfe fortschrittlicher Crawling-Technologien sammelt","pt":"O readme-i18n-sync é uma ferramenta de IA que sincroniza a leitura em múltiplos idiomas, permitindo que os desenvolvedores acessem conhecimento global","ru":"readme-i18n-sync - это инструмент ИИ, который синхронизирует чтение на нескольких языках, позволяя разработчикам получить доступ к глобальным знаниям","ar":"readme-i18n-sync هو أداة ذكاء اصطناعي تتزامن القراءة باللغات المتعددة، مما يسمح للمطورين بالوصول إلى المعرفة العالمية","en":"Crawling for gathering all of world knowldge"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"README-i18n-sync AI工具：同步全球知识","ja":"README-i18n-sync AIエージェント：世界の知識をクロール","ko":"README-i18n-sync AI 에이전트: 세계 지식을 크롤링","es":"Herramientas de AI: readme-i18n-sync","fr":"Outils d''IA: readme-i18n-sync","de":"KI-Tools: readme-i18n-sync","pt":"Ferramentas de IA: readme-i18n-sync","ru":"ИИ Агенты: readme-i18n-sync","ar":"أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي: readme-i18n-sync","en":"readme-i18n-sync"},"description":{"zh":"README-i18n-sync AI工具用于同步和管理全球知识，通过爬虫技术收集和整理数据","ja":"README-i18n-sync AIエージェントは、世界の知識をクロールして管理するために設計されています","ko":"README-i18n-sync AI 에이전트는 세계 지식을 크롤링하고 관리하는 데 사용됩니다","es":"readme-i18n-sync es una herramienta de AI que recopila conocimientos mundiales mediante tecnologías de crawling avanzadas","fr":"readme-i18n-sync est un outil d''IA qui rassemble les connaissances mondiales grâce à des technologies de crawling de pointe","de":"readme-i18n-sync ist ein KI-Tool, das weltweites Wissen mithilfe fortschrittlicher Crawling-Technologien sammelt","pt":"O readme-i18n-sync é uma ferramenta de IA que sincroniza a leitura em múltiplos idiomas, permitindo que os desenvolvedores acessem conhecimento global","ru":"readme-i18n-sync - это инструмент ИИ, который синхронизирует чтение на нескольких языках, позволяя разработчикам получить доступ к глобальным знаниям","ar":"readme-i18n-sync هو أداة ذكاء اصطناعي تتزامن القراءة باللغات المتعددة، مما يسمح للمطورين بالوصول إلى المعرفة العالمية","en":"Crawling for gathering all of world knowldge"},"definition":{"en":"Crawling for gathering all of world knowldge"},"features":{"zh":["支持多语言同步","自动爬虫技术","高效的数据管理","易于使用的界面","支持多种数据格式"],"ja":["多言語対応","自動クロール機能","効率的なデータ管理","使いやすいインターフェース","多種のデータ形式をサポート"],"ko":["다중 언어 지원","자동 크롤링 기능","효율적인 데이터 관리","사용자 친화적인 인터페이스","다양한 데이터 형식 지원"],"es":["Crawling avanzado para recopilar conocimientos","Integración con tecnologías de vanguardia","Compatibilidad con múltiples plataformas","Implementación sencilla con CLI","Soporte para desarrollo de herramientas de AI personalizadas"],"fr":["Crawling de pointe pour rassembler les connaissances","Intégration avec des technologies de pointe","Compatibilité avec plusieurs plateformes","Mise en œuvre simple avec CLI","Prise en charge du développement d''outils d''IA personnalisés"],"de":["Fortgeschrittenes Crawling zum Sammeln von Wissen","Integration mit führenden Technologien","Kompatibilität mit mehreren Plattformen","Einfache Implementierung mit CLI","Unterstützung für die Entwicklung von benutzerdefinierten KI-Tools"],"pt":["Sincronização de leitura em múltiplos idiomas","Acesso a conhecimento global","Ferramenta de IA para desenvolvedores","Suporte a múltiplos formatos de arquivo","Integração com ferramentas de desenvolvimento populares"],"ru":["Синхронизация чтения на нескольких языках","Доступ к глобальным знаниям","Инструмент ИИ для разработчиков","Поддержка нескольких форматов файлов","Интеграция с популярными инструментами разработки"],"ar":["مزامنة القراءة باللغات المتعددة","الوصول إلى المعرفة العالمية","أداة ذكاء اصطناعي للمطورين","دعم للتنسيقات الملفية المتعددة","التكامل مع أدوات التطوير الشائعة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["如何使用README-i18n-sync","什么是AI工具","README-i18n-sync替代品","README-i18n-sync安装指南","README-i18n-sync设置教程","AI工具比较","README-i18n-sync功能","README-i18n-sync用途"],"ja":["README-i18n-syncの使い方","AIエージェントとは","README-i18n-syncの代替","README-i18n-syncのインストール方法","README-i18n-syncの設定ガイド","AIエージェントの比較","README-i18n-syncの機能","README-i18n-syncの用途"],"ko":["README-i18n-sync 사용 방법","AI 에이전트란","README-i18n-sync 대체","README-i18n-sync 설치 가이드","README-i18n-sync 설정 방법","AI 에이전트 비교","README-i18n-sync 기능","README-i18n-sync 용도"],"es":["cómo utilizar readme-i18n-sync","herramientas de AI para desarrolladores","readme-i18n-sync vs alternativas","instalación de readme-i18n-sync","guía de configuración de readme-i18n-sync","desarrollo de herramientas de AI personalizadas","uso de tecnologías de crawling en AI","beneficios de utilizar readme-i18n-sync"],"fr":["comment utiliser readme-i18n-sync","outils d''IA pour développeurs","readme-i18n-sync vs alternatives","installation de readme-i18n-sync","guide de configuration de readme-i18n-sync","développement d''outils d''IA personnalisés","utilisation de technologies de crawling en IA","avantages de l''utilisation de readme-i18n-sync"],"de":["wie man readme-i18n-sync verwendet","KI-Tools für Entwickler","readme-i18n-sync vs Alternativen","Installation von readme-i18n-sync","Konfigurationsanleitung für readme-i18n-sync","Entwicklung von benutzerdefinierten KI-Tools","Verwendung von Crawling-Technologien in KI","Vorteile der Verwendung von readme-i18n-sync"],"pt":["como usar readme-i18n-sync","o que é readme-i18n-sync","ferramentas de ia para desenvolvedores","readme-i18n-sync vs outras ferramentas","guia de instalação do readme-i18n-sync","configuração do readme-i18n-sync","readme-i18n-sync para desenvolvedores"],"ru":["как использовать readme-i18n-sync","что такое readme-i18n-sync","инструменты ИИ для разработчиков","readme-i18n-sync vs другие инструменты","гид по установке readme-i18n-sync","настройка readme-i18n-sync","readme-i18n-sync для разработчиков"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام readme-i18n-sync","ما هو readme-i18n-sync","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي للمطورين","readme-i18n-sync مقابل أدوات أخرى","دليل تثبيت readme-i18n-sync","تكوين readme-i18n-sync","readme-i18n-sync للمطورين"]}},"owner":"hundong2","repo":"Crawl-all-you-need","repoPath":"hundong2/Crawl-all-you-need","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:10.970Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"readme-i18n-sync","description":"Automatically sync README.md translations into README.kr.md, README.jp.md, README.zh.md, and README.fr.md while preserving Markdown structure and language navigation links. Use when a user asks to translate README updates across Korean, Japanese, Chinese, and French or keep localized README files aligned with the English source.","bodyPreview":"# README I18N Sync\n\n## Execute Workflow\n\n1. Read `README.md` as the source of truth.\n2. Translate into Korean, Japanese, Chinese, and French.\n3. Preserve Markdown structure, links, code blocks, tables, badges, and file paths.\n4. Write outputs to:\n- `README.kr.md`\n- `README.jp.md`\n- `README.zh.md`\n- `README.fr.md`\n5. Ensure every README file starts with this navigation row:\n`[English](./README.md) | [한국어](./README.kr.md) | [日本語](./README.jp.md) | [中文](./README.zh.md) | [Français](./README.fr.md)`","body":"# README I18N Sync\n\n## Execute Workflow\n\n1. Read `README.md` as the source of truth.\n2. Translate into Korean, Japanese, Chinese, and French.\n3. Preserve Markdown structure, links, code blocks, tables, badges, and file paths.\n4. Write outputs to:\n- `README.kr.md`\n- `README.jp.md`\n- `README.zh.md`\n- `README.fr.md`\n5. Ensure every README file starts with this navigation row:\n`[English](./README.md) | [한국어](./README.kr.md) | [日本語](./README.jp.md) | [中文](./README.zh.md) | [Français](./README.fr.md)`\n6. Verify section ordering remains identical across all language files.\n\n## Apply Translation Rules\n\n- Translate prose only.\n- Keep commands, code snippets, URLs, and file paths unchanged.\n- Keep heading levels and list/table layout unchanged.\n- Keep tool and product names unchanged unless explicitly requested.\n- Do not add or remove sections.\n\n## Use Automation\n\n- Run `scripts/readme_i18n_sync.sh --engine <codex|claude|copilot|gemini>`.\n- Configure one environment variable for the selected engine:\n- `README_I18N_CODEX_CMD`\n- `README_I18N_CLAUDE_CMD`\n- `README_I18N_COPILOT_CMD`\n- `README_I18N_GEMINI_CMD`\n\n## Read Reference\n\n- Prompt contract: `references/prompt-template.md`\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T02:53:23.729Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Multilingual Support Agents requiring synchronized README translations in Korean, Japanese, Chinese, and French.","zh":"适合需要在韩语、日语、中文和法语中同步README翻译的多语种支持代理","ja":"韓国語、Japanese、日本語、中国語、フランス語でREADME翻译を同期する必要があるマルチリンガルサポートエージェントに適しています","ko":"한국어, 일본어, 중국어, 프랑스어에서 README 번역을 동기화해야 하는 다국어 지원 에이전트에게 적합합니다","es":"Ideal para agentes de soporte multilingüe que requieren traducciones de README sincronizadas en coreano, japonés, chino y francés.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de support multilingues nécessitant des traductions de fichiers README synchronisées en coréen, japonais, chinois et français.","de":"Ideal für mehrsprachige Support-Agenten, die synchronisierte README-Übersetzungen in Koreanisch, Japanisch, Chinesisch und Französisch benötigen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Suporte Multilíngue que requerem traduções de README sincronizadas em coreano, japonês, chinês e francês.","ru":"Идеально подходит для многоязычных агентов поддержки, требующих синхронизированных переводов файлов README на корейский, японский, китайский и французский языки.","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء الدعم المتعددة اللغات الذين يحتاجون إلى ترجمات README متزامنة باللغات الكورية واليابانية والصينية والفرنسية."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to maintain consistent Markdown structure, links, code blocks, tables, badges, and file paths across multiple language translations, utilizing Markdown parsing and machine translation protocols.","zh":"赋予代理商在多种语言翻译中保持一致的Markdown结构、链接、代码块、表格、徽章和文件路径的能力，利用Markdown解析和机器翻译协议","ja":"マークダウン構造、リンク、コードブロック、テーブル、バッジ、ファイルパスを複数の言語翻訳で一貫性を維持するエージェントの能力を付与し、マークダウン解析と機械翻訳プロトコルを利用する","ko":"다중 언어 번역에서 일관된 Markdown 구조, 링크, 코드 블록, 테이블, 배지 및 파일 경로를 유지할 수 있는 에이전트의 능력을 부여하며, Markdown 파싱 및 기계 번역 프로토콜을 활용합니다","es":"Permite a los agentes mantener una estructura de Markdown consistente, enlaces, bloques de código, tablas, insignias y rutas de archivo en varias traducciones de idiomas, utilizando protocolos de análisis de Markdown y traducción automática.","fr":"Permet aux agents de maintenir une structure Markdown cohérente, des liens, des blocs de code, des tableaux, des badges et des chemins de fichiers à travers plusieurs traductions de langues, en utilisant des protocoles d''analyse Markdown et de traduction automatique.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, eine konsistente Markdown-Struktur, Links, Code-Blöcke, Tabellen, Abzeichen und Dateipfade über mehrere Sprachübersetzungen hinweg beizubehalten, indem Markdown-Analyse- und Maschinentranslationsprotokolle verwendet werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a manter uma estrutura de Markdown consistente, links, blocos de código, tabelas, distintivos e caminhos de arquivo em várias traduções de idiomas, utilizando protocolos de análise e tradução de Markdown.","ru":"Позволяет агентам поддерживать последовательную структуру Markdown, ссылки, блоки кода, таблицы, значки и пути к файлам при нескольких языковых переводах, используя протоколы разбора и машинного перевода Markdown.","ar":"يتمكن الوكلاء من الحفاظ على هيكل Markdown متسق، وصلات، كتل من الكود، جداول، شارات، ومسارات الملف عبر ترجمات متعددة اللغات، باستخدام بروتوكولات تحليل وترجمة الآلة لملفات Markdown."},"useCases":{"en":["Translating README files for open-source projects","Synchronizing documentation across different languages","Automating multilingual support for software applications"],"zh":["为开源项目翻译README文件","在不同语言中同步文档","为软件应用程序自动化多语言支持"],"ja":["オープンソースプロジェクトのREADMEファイルを翻訳する","異なる言語間でドキュメントを同期する","ソフトウェアアプリケーション向けの多言語サポートを自動化する"],"ko":["오픈소스 프로젝트의 README 파일 번역","다른 언어 간의 문서 동기화","소프트웨어 애플리케이션을 위한 다국어 지원 자동화"],"es":["Traducir archivos README para proyectos de código abierto","Sincronizar la documentación en diferentes idiomas","Automatizar el soporte multilingüe para aplicaciones de software"],"fr":["Traduire des fichiers README pour des projets open source","Synchroniser la documentation dans différentes langues","Automatiser le support multilingue pour les applications logicielles"],"de":["README-Dateien für Open-Source-Projekte übersetzen","Dokumentation in verschiedenen Sprachen synchronisieren","Mehrsprachigen Support für Softwareanwendungen automatisieren"],"pt":["Traduzindo arquivos README para projetos de código aberto","Sincronizando documentação em diferentes idiomas","Automatizando o suporte multilíngue para aplicações de software"],"ru":["Перевод файлов README для проектов с открытым исходным кодом","Синхронизация документации на разных языках","Автоматизация многоязычной поддержки программного обеспечения"],"ar":["ترجمة ملفات README لمشاريع الكود المفتوح","تنسيق الوثائق عبر لغات مختلفة","توفير دعم تلقائي متعددة اللغات لتطبيقات البرامج"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires source README.md file","Limited to four target languages: Korean, Japanese, Chinese, and French","Preserves Markdown structure but may require manual adjustment for complex formatting"],"zh":["需要源README.md文件","仅限四种目标语言：韩语、日语、中文和法语","保持Markdown结构，但可能需要手动调整复杂的格式"],"ja":["ソースREADME.mdファイルが必要","対象言語は韓国語、Japanese、日本語、中国語、フランス語の4つに限定される","マークダウン構造は保持されるが、複雑な書式設定の場合には手動での調整が必要となる場合がある"],"ko":["원본 README.md 파일이 필요함","대상 언어는 한국어, 일본어, 중국어, 프랑스어 4개로 제한됨","Markdown 구조는 유지되지만, 복잡한 형식의 경우 수동으로 조정해야 할 수 있음"],"es":["Requiere un archivo README.md de origen","Limitado a cuatro idiomas objetivo: coreano, japonés, chino y francés","Mantiene la estructura de Markdown, pero puede requerir ajustes manuales para formatos complejos"],"fr":["Nécessite un fichier README.md source","Limité à quatre langues cibles : coréen, japonais, chinois et français","Préserve la structure Markdown mais peut nécessiter des ajustements manuels pour des mises en page complexes"],"de":["Benötigt eine Quelldatei README.md","Begrenzt auf vier Ziel-Sprachen: Koreanisch, Japanisch, Chinesisch und Französisch","Bewahrt die Markdown-Struktur, kann aber manuelle Anpassungen für komplexe Formatierungen erfordern"],"pt":["Requer arquivo README.md de origem","Limitado a quatro idiomas alvo: coreano, japonês, chinês e francês","Preserva a estrutura de Markdown, mas pode exigir ajuste manual para formatação complexa"],"ru":["Требуется исходный файл README.md","Ограничен четырьмя целевыми языками: корейским, японским, китайским и французским","Сохраняет структуру Markdown, но может потребовать ручной настройки для сложного форматирования"],"ar":["يتطلب ملف README.md الأصلي","محدود بأربعة لغات محددة: الكورية واليابانية والصينية والفرنسية","يحافظ على هيكل Markdown، لكن قد يتطلب تعديل يدوي لتنسيق معقد"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"24ac72ba46b97759b53794659751934beee54d92c3267e3a95a8696d70e27000","qualityScore":24}');
