語のサポートを検証","AI ツール","AI開発ツール"],"ko":["AI 에이전트","verify-language-support","Clarity","AI-native 개발자","코딩 에이전트","언어의 지원을 검증","AI 도구","AI 개발 도구"],"es":["cómo verificar la compatibilidad de lenguaje para Agentes de IA","herramientas de IA para desarrolladores","Clarity alternativa","Clarity vs otros herramientas de IA","instalación de Clarity","guía de configuración de Clarity","desarrollo de IA con Clarity"],"fr":["comment vérifier la prise en charge des langues pour les Agents IA","outils d''IA pour les développeurs","Clarity alternative","Clarity vs autres outils d''IA","installation de Clarity","guide de configuration de Clarity","développement d''IA avec Clarity"],"de":["wie man die Sprachunterstützung für KI-Agents überprüft","KI-Tools für Entwickler","Clarity-Alternative","Clarity vs andere KI-Tools","Clarity-Installation","Clarity-Konfigurationsanleitung","KI-Entwicklung mit Clarity"],"pt":["como usar verify-language-support","clarity ai tool alternative","verificar linguagens programação","automacao suporte idiomas","clarity vs linguist","install clarity language skill","setup verify-language-support","ai agent desenvolvimento","clarity tool integração CI/CD"],"ru":["как использовать verify-language-support","clarity ИИ инструмент альтернатива","проверить поддержку языков программирования","автоматизация проверки языков","clarity vs linguist","установить clarity language skill","настройка verify-language-support","ИИ агент разработка","clarity интеграция CI/CD"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام verify-language-support","بدائل أداة Clarity للذكاء الاصطناعي","التحقق من دعم لغات البرمجة","أتمتة فحص اللغة","Clarity مقابل Linguist","تثبيت مهارة لغة Clarity","إعداد verify-language-support","وكيل ذكاء اصطناعي للتطوير","تكامل Clarity مع CI/CD"]}},"owner":"LegacyCodeHQ","repo":"clarity","repoPath":"LegacyCodeHQ/clarity","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:10.993Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"verify-language-support","description":"End-to-end workflow for validating language support changes in the clarity dependency graph analyzer","bodyPreview":"Use this workflow to validate language support end-to-end in `clarity`.\n\n## Prepare\n\n1. Identify the target language module under `depgraph/<language>/`.\n2. Identify affected command output in `cmd/languages/` when maturity level changes.\n3. Confirm current local changes with `git status --short`.\n\n## Verify Parser/Resolver Behavior\n\n1. Run targeted tests first:\n   - `go test ./depgraph/<language>`\n2. If behavior changed, add or update regression tests near changed logic:\n   - Parser tests in `d","body":"Use this workflow to validate language support end-to-end in `clarity`.\n\n## Prepare\n\n1. Identify the target language module under `depgraph/<language>/`.\n2. Identify affected command output in `cmd/languages/` when maturity level changes.\n3. Confirm current local changes with `git status --short`.\n\n## Verify Parser/Resolver Behavior\n\n1. Run targeted tests first:\n   - `go test ./depgraph/<language>`\n2. If behavior changed, add or update regression tests near changed logic:\n   - Parser tests in `depgraph/<language>/parser_*_test.go`\n   - Resolver tests in `depgraph/<language>/*resolver*_test.go` (or add one)\n3. Prefer symbol-usage-based assertions over package-level assumptions.\n\n## Validate on a Real Repository (Always Interactive)\n\n1. Pick a representative repo for the language.\n2. Clone into `/tmp`.\n3. Build a review queue before rendering graphs:\n   - Use non-merge commits only.\n   - Use commits with `5-30` changed files.\n   - Prioritize commits that are mostly about the target language (based on file extensions/paths).\n   - Each selected commit should include at least a few files in the target language (minimum 3 unless unavailable).\n   - Default queue size is 10 commits unless the user requests a different count.\n4. Show the queue to the user before starting graph renders.\n5. Render exactly one commit at a time in the IDE:\n   - Show commit context immediately before the diagram:\n     - `git -C /tmp/<repo> show -s --format=''%h %s'' <sha>`\n   - In chat, print the commit message line before the Mermaid block so the user knows what change they are reviewing.\n   - `go run . graph --repo /tmp/<repo> -c <sha> -f mermaid`\n   - Always include the rendered diagram directly in chat (Mermaid fenced block). If Mermaid is not visible, provide DOT/text fallback in chat.\n   - If diagrams still are not visible to the user, generate and open the graph URL in the browser (for example `clarity graph -u` or equivalent URL output).\n6. Pause after each commit and wait for explicit user confirmation (for example, `next`) before continuing.\n7. Continue this request/response loop until the queue is complete or the user stops.\n8. After completing the default 10-commit queue, ask:\n   - \"Do you want me to proceed with updating maturity level and committing the changes?\"\n   - If the user says yes, do it immediately without extra confirmation:\n     - Update module maturity as justified by validation results.\n     - Update `cmd/languages` golden output if changed.\n     - Run quality gates (`make lint`, `make test`).\n     - Commit the changes with a focused `type: subject` message.\n9. Keep validation focused on edge quality for each commit:\n   - Production file incorrectly depends on test file\n   - Fan-out caused by same-name declarations across source sets/targets\n   - Missing edges where symbols are clearly referenced\n10. If the user asks a side question during review (for example what `.in` means), answer briefly and then resume the queue when prompted.\n\n## Fixing Issues\n\n1. Update parser extraction to collect real referenced symbols.\n2. Update resolver logic to map imports/references to concrete declarations.\n3. Avoid package-wide linking for imports.\n4. For ambiguous symbol definitions (multiple files define same symbol), skip linking unless disambiguation is available.\n5. Add regression tests covering the exact failing pattern from real commits.\n\n## Quality Gates\n\n1. Run lint and full tests:\n   - `make lint`\n   - `make test`\n2. If `cmd/languages` output changes (for example, maturity icon changed), update golden:\n   - `go test ./cmd/languages -run TestLanguagesCommand_PrintsSupportedLanguagesAndExtensions -update`\n   - Re-run `make test`\n\n## Review Graph of Local Changes\n\n1. If 3 or more files changed, run:\n   - `./clarity graph -f mermaid`\n2. Ensure test-to-code directionality and dependency density look plausible.\n\n## Handoff Checklist\n\n1. Summarize what changed and why.\n2. Include exact files touched.\n3. Include command results for `make lint` and `make test`.\n4. If commit is requested, use one focused commit message in `type: subject` format.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T03:03:33.175Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for AI coding agents specializing in language toolchain development and dependency graph validation.","zh":"非常适合专注于语言工具链开发和依赖关系图验证的 AI 编码智能体。","ja":"言語ツールチェーンの開発と依存関係グラフの検証に特化した AI コーディングエージェントに最適です。","ko":"언어 툴체인 개발 및 의존성 그래프 검증에 특화된 AI 코딩 에이전트에 이상적입니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de codificación de IA especializados en el desarrollo de toolchain de lenguaje y validación de gráficos de dependencia.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de codification IA spécialisés dans le développement de toolchain de langage et la validation de graphes de dépendances.","de":"Ideal für KI-Coding-Agents, die sich auf die Entwicklung von Language-Toolchains und die Validierung von Dependency-Graphen spezialisieren.","pt":"Ideal para agentes de IA de codificação especializados no desenvolvimento de toolchain de linguagem e validação de grafo de dependências.","ru":"Идеально подходит для ИИ-агентов программирования, специализирующихся на разработке инструментальных цепочек языка и валидации графа зависимостей.","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي المختصين في البرمجة والمتخصصين في تطوير سلسلة أدوات اللغة والتحقق من صحة مخطط التبعيات."},"recommendation":{"en":"Enables comprehensive end-to-end validation of language support modules within the Clarity design tool. Provides targeted testing capabilities for parser/resolver behavior and regression test management for dependency graph changes.","zh":"支持对 Clarity 设计工具内的语言支持模块进行全面的端到端验证。为解析器/解析程序行为提供针对性的测试能力，并为依赖关系图的变更管理回归测试。","ja":"Clarity デザインツール内の言語サポートモジュールに対する包括的なエンドツーエンド検証を可能にします。パーサー/リゾルバーの動作に対する標的型テスト機能と、依存関係グラフの変更に対する回帰テスト管理を提供します。","ko":"Clarity 디자인 도구 내의 언어 지원 모듈에 대한 포괄적인 엔드투엔드 검증을 가능하게 합니다. 파서/리졸버 동작에 대한 표적 테스트 기능과 변경된 의존성 그래프 로직에 대한 회귀 테스트 관리를 제공합니다.","es":"Permite una validación integral de extremo a extremo de los módulos de soporte de lenguaje dentro de la herramienta de diseño Clarity. Proporciona capacidades de prueba específicas para el comportamiento del parser/resolver y gestión de pruebas de regresión para cambios en el gráfico de dependencia.","fr":"Permet une validation complète de bout en bout des modules de support linguistique dans l''outil de conception Clarity. Fournit des capacités de test ciblées pour le comportement du parser/resolver et la gestion des tests de régression pour les modifications du graphe de dépendances.","de":"Ermöglicht eine umfassende End-to-End-Validierung von Language-Support-Modulen innerhalb des Clarity-Design-Tools. Bietet gezielte Testfähigkeiten für das Verhalten von Parser/Resolver und die Verwaltung von Regressionstests für Dependency-Graph-Änderungen.","pt":"Permite uma validação abrangente de ponta a ponta dos módulos de suporte a linguagem dentro da ferramenta de design Clarity. Fornece capacidades de teste direcionadas para o comportamento do parser/resolver e gerenciamento de testes de regressão para alterações no grafo de dependências.","ru":"Обеспечивает комплексную сквозную валидацию модулей поддержки языка в инструменте проектирования Clarity. Предоставляет целевые возможности тестирования для поведения парсера/резолвера и управления регрессионными тестами для изменений в графе зависимостей.","ar":"يتيح التحقق الشامل من البداية إلى النهاية لوحدات دعم اللغة داخل أداة التصميم Clarity. يوفر إمكانيات اختبار مستهدفة لسلوك المحلل/المحلل وأدارة اختبارات الانحدار لتغييرات مخطط التبعيات."},"useCases":{"en":["Validating parser behavior changes in depgraph/<language>/ modules","Testing command output changes in cmd/languages/ when maturity levels shift","Managing regression tests for modified dependency graph logic"],"zh":["验证 depgraph/<language>/ 模块中解析器行为的变更","测试当成熟度等级变更时 cmd/languages/ 中的命令输出变化","管理修改后的依赖关系图逻辑的回归测试"],"ja":["depgraph/<language>/ モジュールにおけるパーサー動作変更の検証","成熟度レベルが変更された時の cmd/languages/ 内のコマンド出力変化のテスト","変更された依存関係グラフロジックの回帰テストの管理"],"ko":["depgraph/<language>/ 모듈에서 파서 동작 변경 사항 검증","성숙도 수준이 변경될 때 cmd/languages/ 내의 명령어 출력 변화 테스트","수정된 의존성 그래프 로직에 대한 회귀 테스트 관리"],"es":["Validación de cambios en el comportamiento del parser en módulos depgraph/<language>/","Prueba de cambios en la salida de comandos en cmd/languages/ cuando los niveles de madurez cambian","Gestión de pruebas de regresión para lógica de gráficos de dependencia modificada"],"fr":["Validation des changements de comportement du parser dans les modules depgraph/<language>/","Test des changements de sortie de commande dans cmd/languages/ lorsque les niveaux de maturité changent","Gestion des tests de régression pour la logique modifiée du graphe de dépendances"],"de":["Validierung von Parser-Verhaltensänderungen in depgraph/<language>/ Modulen","Testen von Kommandoausgabeänderungen in cmd/languages/ bei Verschiebungen von Reifegraden","Verwaltung von Regressionstests für modifizierte Dependency-Graph-Logik"],"pt":["Validar alterações no comportamento do parser em módulos depgraph/<language>/","Testar alterações na saída de comando em cmd/languages/ quando os níveis de maturidade mudam","Gerenciar testes de regressão para lógica de grafo de dependências modificada"],"ru":["Валидация изменений в поведении парсера в модулях depgraph/<language>/","Тестирование изменений вывода команд в cmd/languages/ при смене уровней зрелости","Управление регрессионными тестами для измененной логики графа зависимостей"],"ar":["التحقق من تغييرات سلوك المحلل في وحدات depgraph/<language>/","اختبار تغييرات مخرجات الأوامر في cmd/languages/ عند تغير مستويات النضج","إدارة اختبارات الانحدار لمنطق مخطط التبعيات المعدل"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Git repository access for change confirmation","Dependent on Go test infrastructure","Specifically designed for Clarity''s depgraph structure"],"zh":["需要 Git 仓库访问权限以确认变更","依赖于 Go 测试基础设施","专为 Clarity 的 depgraph 结构设计"],"ja":["変更確認のために Git リポジトリへのアクセスが必要","Go テストインフラに依存","Clarity の depgraph 構造に特化して設計"],"ko":["변경 사항 확인을 위해 Git 저장소 접근 권한 필요","Go 테스트 인프라에 종속됨","Clarity의 depgraph 구조에 맞춰 특별히 설계됨"],"es":["Requiere acceso a repositorio Git para confirmación de cambios","Depende de la infraestructura de pruebas de Go","Específicamente diseñado para la estructura depgraph de Clarity"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès au dépôt Git pour la confirmation des changements","Dépend de l''infrastructure de test Go","Spécifiquement conçu pour la structure depgraph de Clarity"],"de":["Erfordert Git-Repository-Zugang zur Änderungsbestätigung","Abhängig von der Go-Testinfrastruktur","Speziell für die Depgraph-Struktur von Clarity entwickelt"],"pt":["Requer acesso ao repositório Git para confirmação de alterações","Dependente da infraestrutura de teste Go","Especificamente projetado para a estrutura depgraph do Clarity"],"ru":["Требует доступ к репозиторию Git для подтверждения изменений","Зависит от инфраструктуры тестирования Go","Специально разработано для структуры depgraph Clarity"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى مستودع Git لتأكيد التغيير","يعتمد على بنية اختبار Go","مصمم خصيصًا لهيكل depgraph الخاص بـ Clarity"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"8235a0124ad4176fdd8826a42f197ae49ab32af2010420f1cd8ce97cc0988156","qualityScore":24}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('yiyousiow000814/XAUUSD-Calendar-Agent/ui-check-framework', 'community', 'yiyousiow000814', 'XAUUSD-Calendar-Agent', 'yiyousiow000814/XAUUSD-Calendar-Agent', 'ui-check-framework', 0, 0, 24, '2026-03-02T01:56:10.995Z', '2026-03-02T03:04:01.374Z', '2d107e4224db90e7d2524051832e87ff3a0e99baa61d7795fd3b5e3ef88004b5', '{"id":"yiyousiow000814/XAUUSD-Calendar-Agent/ui-check-framework","name":"ui-check-framework","description":{"zh":"UI检查框架是XAUUSD日历代理的重要组成部分，用于优化开发流程和提高效率","ja":"UIチェックフレームワークはXAUUSDカレンダーエージェントの重要なコンポーネントであり、開発プロセスを最適化し、効率を向上させるために使用されます","ko":"UI 검사 프레임워크는 XAUUSD 달력 에이전트의重要한 구성 요소로 개발 프로세스를 최적화하고 효율성을 향상시키는 데 사용됩니다","es":"El ui-check-framework es una herramienta de AI para verificar la interfaz de usuario en proyectos de XAUUSD. Ayuda a los desarrolladores a detectar errores y mejorar la experiencia del usuario","fr":"Le ui-check-framework est un outil d''IA pour vérifier l''interface utilisateur dans les projets XAUUSD. Il aide les développeurs à détecter les erreurs et améliorer l''expérience utilisateur","de":"Das ui-check-framework ist ein KI-Tool zur Überprüfung der Benutzeroberfläche in XAUUSD-Projekten. Es hilft Entwicklern, Fehler zu erkennen und die Benutzererfahrung zu verbessern","pt":"O ui-check-framework é uma ferramenta de AI para melhorar a experiência do usuário com o Calendário XAUUSD, permitindo desenvolvedores criar interfaces mais eficazes","ru":"ИИ Агент ui-check-framework предназначен для улучшения пользовательского опыта с Календарем XAUUSD, позволяя разработчикам создавать более эффективные интерфейсы","ar":"أداة الذكاء الاصطناعي ui-check-framework مصممة لتحسين تجربة المستخدم مع تقويم XAUUSD، مما يسمح للمطورين بإنشاء واجهات أكثر فعالية","en":"XAUUSD Calendar Agent"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"UI检查框架 - AI智能代理","ja":"UIチェックフレームワーク - AIエージェント","ko":"UI 검사 프레임워크 - AI 에이전트","es":"Herra