nt","Compatibilité avec de multiples formats de données","Interface utilisateur intuitive"],"de":["Suche in mehreren Inventarstandorten","Reparatur und Korrektur von Metadaten","Integration mit Entwicklungstools","Kompatibilität mit mehreren Datenformaten","Benutzerfreundliche Oberfläche"],"pt":["Busca em múltiplos locais de inventário","Correção automática de metadados","Suporte a múltiplos formatos de dados","Integração com sistemas de gerenciamento de inventário","Relatórios detalhados de erros e correções"],"ru":["Поиск по нескольким местам хранения","Автоматическая коррекция метаданных","Поддержка нескольких форматов данных","Интеграция с системами управления инвентарем","Детальные отчеты об ошибках и коррекциях"],"ar":["بحث في متعدد مواقع المخازن","تصحيح آلي للبيانات الوصفية","دعم لعدة صيغ بيانات","التكامل مع أنظمة إدارة المخازن","تقارير مفصلة عن الأخطاء والتصحيحات"]},"keywords":{"zh":["如何使用AI工具修复元数据","什么是AI工具","AI工具与传统工具的区别","AI工具安装指南","AI工具设置教程","AI工具修复元数据","元数据管理","库存搜索","AI技术"],"ja":["AIエージェントを使用してメタデータを修復する方法","AIエージェントとは","AIエージェントと伝統的なツールの違い","AIエージェントのインストールガイド","AIエージェントの設定チュートリアル","AIエージェントを使用してメタデータを修復","メタデータ管理","在庫検索","AI技術"],"ko":["AI 에이전트를 사용하여 메타데이터를 수정하는 방법","AI 에이전트란","AI 에이전트와 전통적인 도구의 차이","AI 에이전트 설치 가이드","AI 에이전트 설정 튜토리얼","AI 에이전트를 사용하여 메타데이터를 수정","메타데이터 관리","재고 검색","AI 기술"],"es":["cómo reparar metadatos","herramientas de inteligencia artificial","Agente de reparación de metadatos","alternativas a herramientas de metadatos","guía de instalación de Agente de reparación de metadatos","corrección de metadatos en inventarios de desguaces","desarrollo de software con inteligencia artificial","integración de herramientas de desarrollo con Agente de reparación de metadatos"],"fr":["comment réparer les métadonnées","outils d''intelligence artificielle","Agent de correction de métadonnées","alternatives aux outils de métadonnées","guide d''installation de l''Agent de correction de métadonnées","correction des métadonnées dans les inventaires de casse","développement de logiciels avec intelligence artificielle","intégration d''outils de développement avec l''Agent de correction de métadonnées"],"de":["wie repariere ich Metadaten","KI-Tools","Metadaten-Reparatur-Agent","Alternativen zu Metadaten-Tools","Installationsanleitung für den Metadaten-Reparatur-Agent","Korrektur von Metadaten in Inventaren von Scrapyards","Softwareentwicklung mit KI","Integration von Entwicklungstools mit dem Metadaten-Reparatur-Agent"],"pt":["ferramentas de ia","correção de metadados","inventário de ferro-velho","como usar ferramentas de ia","o que é correção de metadados","ferramentas de ia para inventário","correção de metadados em python","ferramentas de ia em react"],"ru":["ИИ Агенты","исправление метаданных","инвентарь автозапчастей","как использовать ИИ Агенты","что такое исправление метаданных","ИИ Агенты для инвентаря","исправление метаданных на python","ИИ Агенты в react"],"ar":["أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","إصلاح البيانات الوصفية","مخازن السيارات المصدومة","كيفية استخدام أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","ما هي إصلاح البيانات الوصفية","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي للمخازن","إصلاح البيانات الوصفية بPYTHON","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي في react"]}},"owner":"AugusDogus","repo":"junkyard-index","repoPath":"AugusDogus/junkyard-index","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:11.009Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"fixing-metadata","description":"Ship correct, complete metadata.","bodyPreview":"# fixing-metadata\n\nShip correct, complete metadata.\n\n## how to use\n\n- `/fixing-metadata`\n  Apply these constraints to any metadata work in this conversation.\n\n- `/fixing-metadata <file>`\n  Review the file against all rules below and report:\n  - violations (quote the exact line or snippet)\n  - why it matters (one short sentence)\n  - a concrete fix (code-level suggestion)\n\nDo not introduce new frameworks or SEO libraries unless explicitly requested. Prefer minimal diffs.\n\n## when to apply\n\nReferen","body":"# fixing-metadata\n\nShip correct, complete metadata.\n\n## how to use\n\n- `/fixing-metadata`\n  Apply these constraints to any metadata work in this conversation.\n\n- `/fixing-metadata <file>`\n  Review the file against all rules below and report:\n  - violations (quote the exact line or snippet)\n  - why it matters (one short sentence)\n  - a concrete fix (code-level suggestion)\n\nDo not introduce new frameworks or SEO libraries unless explicitly requested. Prefer minimal diffs.\n\n## when to apply\n\nReference these guidelines when:\n\n- adding or changing page titles, descriptions, canonical, robots\n- implementing Open Graph or Twitter card metadata\n- setting favicons, app icons, manifest, theme-color\n- building shared SEO components or layout metadata defaults\n- adding structured data (JSON-LD)\n- changing locale, alternate languages, or canonical routing\n- shipping new pages, marketing pages, or shareable links\n\n## rule categories by priority\n\n| priority | category                    | impact     |\n| -------- | --------------------------- | ---------- |\n| 1        | correctness and duplication | critical   |\n| 2        | title and description       | high       |\n| 3        | canonical and indexing      | high       |\n| 4        | social cards                | high       |\n| 5        | icons and manifest          | medium     |\n| 6        | structured data             | medium     |\n| 7        | locale and alternates       | low-medium |\n| 8        | tool boundaries             | critical   |\n\n## quick reference\n\n### 1. correctness and duplication (critical)\n\n- define metadata in one place per page, avoid competing systems\n- do not emit duplicate title, description, canonical, or robots tags\n- metadata must be deterministic, no random or unstable values\n- escape and sanitize any user-generated or dynamic strings\n- every page must have safe defaults for title and description\n\n### 2. title and description (high)\n\n- every page must have a title\n- use a consistent title format across the site\n- keep titles short and readable, avoid stuffing\n- shareable or searchable pages should have a meta description\n- descriptions must be plain text, no markdown or quote spam\n\n### 3. canonical and indexing (high)\n\n- canonical must point to the preferred URL for the page\n- use noindex only for private, duplicate, or non-public pages\n- robots meta must match actual access intent\n- previews or staging pages should be noindex by default when possible\n- paginated pages must have correct canonical behavior\n\n### 4. social cards (high)\n\n- shareable pages must set Open Graph title, description, and image\n- Open Graph and Twitter images must use absolute URLs\n- prefer correct image dimensions and stable aspect ratios\n- og:url must match the canonical URL\n- use a sensible og:type, usually website or article\n- set twitter:card appropriately, summary_large_image by default\n\n### 5. icons and manifest (medium)\n\n- include at least one favicon that works across browsers\n- include apple-touch-icon when relevant\n- manifest must be valid and referenced when used\n- set theme-color intentionally to avoid mismatched UI chrome\n- icon paths should be stable and cacheable\n\n### 6. structured data (medium)\n\n- do not add JSON-LD unless it clearly maps to real page content\n- JSON-LD must be valid and reflect what is actually rendered\n- do not invent ratings, reviews, prices, or organization details\n- prefer one structured data block per page unless required\n\n### 7. locale and alternates (low-medium)\n\n- set the html lang attribute correctly\n- set og:locale when localization exists\n- add hreflang alternates only when pages truly exist\n- localized pages must canonicalize correctly per locale\n\n### 8. tool boundaries (critical)\n\n- prefer minimal changes, do not refactor unrelated code\n- do not migrate frameworks or SEO libraries unless requested\n- follow the project’s existing metadata pattern (Next.js metadata API, react-helmet, manual head, etc.)\n\n## review guidance\n\n- fix critical issues first (duplicates, canonical, indexing)\n- ensure title, description, canonical, and og:url agree\n- verify social cards on a real URL, not localhost\n- prefer stable, boring metadata over clever or dynamic\n- keep diffs minimal and scoped to metadata only\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T03:08:24.705Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Data Curation Agents needing precise metadata correction and validation capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要精确元数据更正和验证能力的数据策展代理。","ja":"正確なメタデータの修正と検証機能を必要とするデータキュレーションエージェントに最適です。","ko":"정확한 메타데이터 수정 및 검증 기능을 필요로 하는 데이터 큐레이션 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Curación de Datos que necesitan capacidades de corrección y validación de metadatos precisas.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents de Curation de Données ayant besoin de capacités de correction et de validation de métadonnées précises.","de":"Perfekt für Data Curation Agents, die präzise Metadatenkorrektur- und Validierungsfunktionen benötigen.","pt":"Perfect for Data Curation Agents needing precise metadata correction and validation capabilities.","ru":"Perfect for Data Curation Agents needing precise metadata correction and validation capabilities.","ar":"Perfect for Data Curation Agents needing precise metadata correction and validation capabilities."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to ship correct and complete metadata by applying constraints and reviewing files against predefined rules, utilizing minimal diffs and avoiding introduction of new frameworks or SEO libraries unless explicitly requested.","zh":"通过应用约束和检查文件以预定义规则，利用最小的差异，并避免引入新的框架或 SEO 库，除非明确请求，赋予代理输出正确和完整的元数据的能力。","ja":"事前に定義されたルールに従ってファイルを確認し、最小限の差分を使用し、明示的に要求されない限り、新しいフレームワークや SEO ライブラリの導入を避けることで、エージェントが正確で完全なメタデータを出力できるようになります。","ko":"사전에 정의된 규칙에 따라 파일을 확인하고 최소한의 차이를 사용하며 명시적으로 요청되지 않는 한 새로운 프레임워크 또는 SEO 라이브러리의 도입을 피함으로써 에이전트가 정확하고 완전한 메타데이터를 출력할 수 있는 기능을 부여합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a enviar metadatos correctos y completos aplicando restricciones y revisando archivos contra reglas predefinidas, utilizando diferencias mínimas y evitando la introducción de nuevos frameworks o bibliotecas de SEO a menos que se solicite explícitamente.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''envoyer des métadonnées correctes et complètes en appliquant des contraintes et en révisant les fichiers contre des règles prédéfinies, en utilisant des différences minimales et en évitant l''introduction de nouveaux frameworks ou bibliothèques de référencement SEO à moins que cela ne soit explicitement demandé.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, korrekte und vollständige Metadaten zu liefern, indem sie Einschränkungen anwenden und Dateien gegen vordefinierte Regeln überprüfen, minimale Diffs verwenden und die Einführung neuer Frameworks oder SEO-Bibliotheken vermeiden, es sei denn, dies wird explizit angefordert.","pt":"Empowers agents to ship correct and complete metadata by applying constraints and reviewing files against predefined rules, utilizing minimal diffs and avoiding introduction of new frameworks or SEO libraries unless explicitly requested.","ru":"Empowers agents to ship correct and complete metadata by applying constraints and reviewing files against predefined rules, utilizing minimal diffs and avoiding introduction of new frameworks or SEO libraries unless explicitly requested.","ar":"Empowers agents to ship correct and complete metadata by applying constraints and reviewing files against predefined rules, utilizing minimal diffs and avoiding introduction of new frameworks or SEO libraries unless explicitly requested."},"useCases":{"en":["Reviewing files for metadata violations and providing concrete fixes","Applying metadata constraints to ensure data consistency across multiple salvage yard inventory locations","Validating metadata completeness and accuracy for nationwide searches"],"zh":["检查文件的元数据违规并提供具体的修复方法","将元数据约束应用于确保多个废品场库存位置之间的数据一致性","验证元数据的完整性和准确性以进行全国范围的搜索"],"ja":["メタデータの違反を検証し、具体的な修正策を提供する","事前に定義されたルールに従ってファイルを確認し、複数のサルベージヤード在庫ロケーション間のデータの一貫性を確保する","全国的な検索のためにメタデータの完全性と正確性を検証する"],"ko":["메타데이터 위반을 검사하고 구체적인 수정 방법을 제공한다","사전에 정의된 규칙에 따라 파일을 확인하고 여러 차량 매장 재고 위치 간의 데이터 일관성을 보장한다","전국적인 검색을 위해 메타데이터의 완전성과 정확성을 검증한다"],"es":["Revisar archivos para violaciones de metadatos y proporcionar correcciones concretas","Aplicar restricciones de metadatos para garantizar la consistencia de los datos en múltiples ubicaciones de inventario de desguaces","Validar la completitud y exactitud de los metadatos para búsquedas a nivel nacional"],"fr":["Réviser les fichiers pour les violations de métadonnées et fournir des corrections concrètes","Appliquer des contraintes de métadonnées pour assurer la cohérence des données dans de multiples emplacements d''inventaire de casse","Valider l''exhaustivité et l''exactitude des métadonnées pour les recherches à l''échelle nationale"],"de":["Dateien auf Metadatenverletzungen überprüfen und konkrete Korrekturen bereitstellen","Metadatenbeschränkungen anwenden, um die Datenkonsistenz in mehreren Inventarstandorten von Schrottplätzen sicherzustellen","Die Vollständigkeit und Genauigkeit der Metadaten für länderweite Suchanfragen überprüfen"],"pt":["Reviewing files for metadata violations and providing concrete fixes","Applying metadata constraints to ensure data consistency across multiple salvage yard inventory locations","Validating metadata completeness and accuracy for nationwide searches"],"ru":["Reviewing files for metadata violations and providing concrete fixes","Applying metadata constraints to ensure data consistency across multiple salvage yard inventory locations","Validating metadata completeness and accuracy for nationwide searches"],"ar":["Reviewing files for metadata violations and providing concrete fixes","Applying metadata constraints to ensure data consistency across multiple salvage yard inventory locations","Validating metadata completeness and accuracy for nationwide searches"]},"limitations"