er: Experte für Fitness mit Wahoo KIKR","pt":"Treinador de Bluetooth: Controle Resistência no Wahoo KIKR","ru":"ИИ Агент Bluetooth: Управление сопротивлением на Wahoo KIKR","ar":"مدرب بلوتوث: تحكم في المقاومة على جهاز Wahoo KIKR","en":"bluetooth-trainer-expert"},"description":{"zh":"Windows 应用程序控制 Wahoo KIKR 的阻力，使锻炼更有趣。使用 AI 技术优化您的训练","ja":"Windows アプリケーションを使用して Wahoo KIKR の抵抗を制御し、トレーニングをより楽しく。AI 技術を使用してトレーニングを最適化","ko":"Windows 애플리케이션을 사용하여 Wahoo KIKR의 저항을 제어하여 운동을 더 재미있게 한다. AI 기술을 사용하여 훈련을 최적화","es":"La aplicación de Windows bluetooth-trainer-expert controla la resistencia en tu Wahoo KIKR para entrenamientos más divertidos y personalizados","fr":"L''application Windows bluetooth-trainer-expert contrôle la résistance sur votre Wahoo KIKR pour des entraînements plus amusants et personnalisés","de":"Die Windows-App bluetooth-trainer-expert steuert die Widerstandskontrolle auf Ihrem Wahoo KIKR für einzigartige und personalisierte Trainings","pt":"O treinador de Bluetooth é um aplicativo do Windows que controla a resistência no Wahoo KIKR para tornar treinos mais divertidos","ru":"ИИ Агент Bluetooth - это приложение для Windows, которое управляет сопротивлением на Wahoo KIKR,使 тренировки более интересными","ar":"مدرب بلوتوث هو تطبيق ويندوز يتحكم في المقاومة على جهاز Wahoo KIKR لجعل التدريبات أكثر متعة","en":"Windows app to control resistance on my Wahoo KIKR to make workouts more fun"},"definition":{"en":"Windows app to control resistance on my Wahoo KIKR to make workouts more fun"},"features":{"zh":["使用 AI 技术控制 Wahoo KIKR 的阻力","优化训练过程","支持 Windows 平台","易于使用的界面","高度可定制"],"ja":["AI 技術を使用して Wahoo KIKR の抵抗を制御","トレーニングプロセスを最適化","Windows プラットフォームをサポート","使いやすいインターフェース","高度にカスタマイズ可能"],"ko":["AI 기술을 사용하여 Wahoo KIKR의 저항을 제어","훈련 프로세스를 최적화","Windows 플랫폼을 지원","사용하기 쉬운 인터페이스","고도 olarak 사용자 정의 가능"],"es":["Control de resistencia en Wahoo KIKR","Entrenamientos personalizados","Integración con aplicaciones de fitness","Interfaz de usuario intuitiva","Compatibilidad con Windows"],"fr":["Contrôle de la résistance sur Wahoo KIKR","Entraînements personnalisés","Intégration avec des applications de fitness","Interface utilisateur intuitive","Compatibilité avec Windows"],"de":["Widerstandskontrolle auf Wahoo KIKR","Einzigartige Trainings","Integration mit Fitness-Anwendungen","Benutzerfreundliche Oberfläche","Kompatibilität mit Windows"],"pt":["Controle de resistência no Wahoo KIKR","Aplicativo do Windows para treinamento","Tornar treinos mais divertidos","Integração com dispositivos Bluetooth","Interface de usuário amigável"],"ru":["Управление сопротивлением на Wahoo KIKR","Приложение для Windows для тренировок","Сделайте тренировки более интересными","Интеграция с устройствами Bluetooth","Дружественный интерфейс пользователя"],"ar":["التحكم في المقاومة على جهاز Wahoo KIKR","تطبيق ويندوز للتدريب","جعل التدريبات أكثر متعة","التكامل مع أجهزة البلوتوث","واجهة مستخدم友دية"]},"keywords":{"zh":["如何使用 Bluetooth 训练专家","什么是 AI 训练","Wahoo KIKR 控制器","Windows 训练应用","AI 训练工具","Bluetooth 训练软件","智能训练设备"],"ja":["Bluetooth トレーナー エキスパートの使い方","AI トレーニングとは","Wahoo KIKR コントローラー","Windows トレーニング アプリ","AI トレーニング ツール","Bluetooth トレーニング ソフト","スマート トレーニング デバイス"],"ko":["블루투스 트레이너 전문家的 사용법","AI 훈련이란","Wahoo KIKR 제어기","Windows 훈련 애플리케이션","AI 훈련 도구","블루투스 훈련 소프트웨어","스마트 훈련 기기"],"es":["cómo usar bluetooth-trainer-expert","qué es un agente de inteligencia artificial","alternativas a Wahoo KIKR","bluetooth-trainer-expert vs otros entrenadores","instalación de bluetooth-trainer-expert","guía de configuración de bluetooth-trainer-expert"],"fr":["comment utiliser bluetooth-trainer-expert","qu''est-ce qu''un outil d''intelligence artificielle","alternatives à Wahoo KIKR","bluetooth-trainer-expert vs autres entraîneurs","installation de bluetooth-trainer-expert","guide de configuration de bluetooth-trainer-expert"],"de":["wie man bluetooth-trainer-expert verwendet","was ist ein künstlicher Intelligenz-Tool","Alternativen zu Wahoo KIKR","bluetooth-trainer-expert vs andere Trainer","Installation von bluetooth-trainer-expert","Einrichtungsanleitung für bluetooth-trainer-expert"],"pt":["como usar treinador de Bluetooth","o que é treinador de Bluetooth","treinador de Bluetooth vs outros aplicativos","instalar treinador de Bluetooth","guia de configuração do treinador de Bluetooth","treinador de Bluetooth para Windows","aplicativos de treinamento para Bluetooth","controle de resistência no Wahoo KIKR"],"ru":["как использовать ИИ Агент Bluetooth","что такое ИИ Агент Bluetooth","ИИ Агент Bluetooth vs другие приложения","установить ИИ Агент Bluetooth","руководство по настройке ИИ Агента Bluetooth","ИИ Агент Bluetooth для Windows","приложения для тренировок на Bluetooth","управление сопротивлением на Wahoo KIKR"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام مدرب بلوتوث","ما هو مدرب بلوتوث","مدرب بلوتوث مقابل تطبيقات أخرى","تثبيت مدرب بلوتوث","دليل إعداد مدرب بلوتوث","مدرب بلوتوث للويندوز","تطبيقات التدريب على البلوتوث","التحكم في المقاومة على جهاز Wahoo KIKR"]}},"owner":"JasonRowe","repo":"Wahoo-KICKR-Randomizer","repoPath":"JasonRowe/Wahoo-KICKR-Randomizer","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:11.089Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"bluetooth-trainer-expert","description":"Expert guidance on reverse-engineering, testing, and integrating Bluetooth Smart Trainers (Wahoo/FTMS) for fitness applications. Use when building or debugging cycling apps.","bodyPreview":"# Bluetooth Trainer Expert\n\nThis skill provides a proven workflow for developing biking fitness applications that interact with Smart Trainers (e.g., Wahoo KICKR, FTMS devices). It emphasizes a \"Console First\" approach to isolate connection and protocol logic before attempting UI integration.\n\n## Core Philosophy\n\n1.  **Console First**: Always prove the protocol logic in a simple C# Console Application (`BikeFitnessConsole`) before touching the main UI (WPF/MAUI).\n2.  **Physical Verification**: T","body":"# Bluetooth Trainer Expert\n\nThis skill provides a proven workflow for developing biking fitness applications that interact with Smart Trainers (e.g., Wahoo KICKR, FTMS devices). It emphasizes a \"Console First\" approach to isolate connection and protocol logic before attempting UI integration.\n\n## Core Philosophy\n\n1.  **Console First**: Always prove the protocol logic in a simple C# Console Application (`BikeFitnessConsole`) before touching the main UI (WPF/MAUI).\n2.  **Physical Verification**: Telemetry (Success/Fail responses) is insufficient for brake logic. You MUST ask the user to \"Pedal and verify resistance change\" to confirm the device actually engaged the magnet/motor.\n3.  **Protocol Agnosticism**: Support both standard FTMS (`0x1826`) and legacy Wahoo (`0xA026...`) protocols.\n\n## Phase 1: Diagnostic Console App\n\nCreate a lightweight console app to handle scanning, connection, and raw command testing.\n\n**Key Features to Implement:**\n-   **Scanner**: Filter for `0x1826` (FTMS), `0xA026` (Wahoo), and `0x1818` (Power).\n-   **Service Explorer**: List all available Services and Characteristics to confirm UUIDs.\n-   **Indication Handler**: **CRITICAL**. You must subscribe to `Indicate` on the Control Point characteristic *before* sending any write commands. Failure to do so often results in silent failures or \"Attribute Not Found\" errors on writes.\n\n## Data Format (Endianness)\n\n**Bluetooth LE GATT characteristics standardly use Little Endian byte order.**\n\n-   **Reading**: When parsing multi-byte values (e.g., Speed, Power, Time), interpret the *least significant byte first*.\n    -   Example: `0xE8 0x03` -> `0x03E8` -> `1000`.\n-   **Writing**: When constructing commands (e.g., Target Watts, Grade), ensure you serialize `UInt16`/`Int16` values to Little Endian.\n-   **Note**: While standard FTMS and common Wahoo OpCodes (`0x40-0x45`) follow Little Endian, always verify proprietary manufacturer-specific characteristics if behavior is unexpected.\n\n## Phase 2: Protocol Identification & Control Points\n\nIdentify the correct Control Point (CP) for the device.\n\n### 1. FTMS (Fitness Machine Service) - Preferred\n*   **Service UUID**: `00001826-0000-1000-8000-00805f9b34fb`\n*   **Control Point**: `00002ad9-0000-1000-8000-00805f9b34fb` (Fitness Machine Control Point)\n*   **Init Sequence**:\n    1.  Subscribe to CP Indications.\n    2.  Send `0x00` (Request Control).\n    3.  Send `0x07` (Start/Resume).\n\n### 2. Wahoo Legacy (KICKR / SNAP)\n*   **Service UUID**: `a026ee01-0a7d-4ab3-97fa-f1500f9feb8b`\n*   **Control Point**: `a026e005-0a7d-4ab3-97fa-f1500f9feb8b` (Often hidden inside the Power Service `0x1818` on some firmware).\n*   **Init Sequence**:\n    1.  Subscribe to CP Indications.\n    2.  Send `0x00` (Init/Unlock).\n\n## Phase 3: OpCode Discovery Strategy\n\nDifferent devices support different modes. Use the Console App to \"Scan\" OpCodes `0x40` through `0x45` by sending `[OpCode, 0x00]` and observing the Indication response.\n\n*   **Response Format**: `01-OpCode-Result` (Where Result `01` = Success, `04` = Not Supported, `40` = Fail).\n*   **Common OpCodes**:\n    *   `0x40` **Level Mode**: 0-9 discrete levels. Basic.\n    *   `0x41` **Resistance Mode**: 0-100% brake force. Most reliable.\n    *   `0x42` **Sim Mode Enable**: Activates physics engine (Grade/Wind/Weight). **Warning**: Many older or lower-end devices (e.g., KICKR SNAP) return \"Success\" for params but FAIL (`0x40`) when trying to Enable this mode.\n    *   `0x43` **Sim Parameters**: Sets Grade, Weight, Crr, Cw.\n\n## Phase 4: \"Fake\" Simulation Mode (Grade Mapping)\n\nIf the device fails to support Native Sim Mode (`0x42`), you must implement **Grade-to-Resistance Mapping** in software to support \"Hilly\" or \"Mountain\" workouts.\n\n**Recommended Mapping (User Calibrated):**\nMap the visual \"Grade %\" to the device''s \"Resistance %\" (OpCode `0x41`).\n\n| Grade Input | Resistance Output | Feel |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| **-10%** | **0.0%** | Coasting / Free spin. |\n| **0%** | **1.0%** | Flat road friction (light). |\n| **20%** | **40.0%** | Steep climb. (Cap at 40% to avoid \"brick wall\"). |\n\n**Logic:**\nUse a piecewise linear function:\n1.  **Downhill (-10 to 0)**: Interpolate 0.0 -> 0.01.\n2.  **Uphill (0 to 20)**: Interpolate 0.01 -> 0.40.\n\n## Phase 5: Telemetry\n\n*   **Power**: Standard `0x2A63` (Cycling Power Measurement).\n*   **Speed/Distance**: Often missing from FTMS on older devices. Calculate locally using **Wheel Revolutions** from the Power Measurement characteristic (Data bytes `flags & 0x10`).\n    *   `Distance = WheelRevs * TireCircumference`\n    *   `Speed = DeltaDistance / DeltaTime`\n*   **Cadence**: Check `0x1816` (Speed & Cadence) or Crank Data in Power (`0x1818`).\n\n## Checklist for Implementation\n\n1.  [ ] **Console Test**: Can you connect and receive Indications?\n2.  [ ] **OpCode Scan**: Which modes return `01` (Success)?\n3.  [ ] **Physical Test**: Does sending `0x41 0x32` (50% res) make it hard to pedal?\n4.  [ ] **Mapping**: Does -10% Grade feel like zero resistance?\n5.  [ ] **UI**: Does the UI display Grade (not raw resistance) to the user?"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T03:31:06.190Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for IoT Agents needing seamless Bluetooth connectivity for fitness applications","zh":"非常适合需要无缝蓝牙连接的IoT Agents用于健身应用","ja":"IoTエージェントがフィットネスアプリケーションでシームレスなBluetooth接続を必要とする場合に最適","ko":"IoT 에이전트가 피트니스 애플리케이션에서 무선 블루투스 연결을 원활하게 하는 데 적합","es":"Perfecto para agentes de IoT que necesitan una conectividad Bluetooth sin problemas para aplicaciones de fitness","fr":"Parfait pour les agents IoT nécessitant une connectivité Bluetooth transparente pour des applications de fitness","de":"Perfekt für IoT-Agents, die eine nahtlose Bluetooth-Verbindung für Fitnessanwendungen benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes IoT que necessitam de conectividade Bluetooth sem interrupções para aplicações de fitness","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов IoT, которым требуется бесперебойное подключение Bluetooth для фитнес-приложений","ar":"مثالي لموكلات الأجهزة الذكية التي تحتاج إلى اتصال بلوتوث بدون انقطاع للطبيقات الرياضية"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to control resistance on smart trainers like Wahoo KICKR using a Console First approach, emphasizing protocol logic with C# Console Applications and integrating with UI frameworks like WPF/MAUI, while leveraging Bluetooth protocols for device interaction","zh":"赋予代理控制Wahoo KICKR等智能训练器上的阻力使用控制台优先方法，强调C#控制台应用程序中的协议逻辑，并与WPF/MAUI等UI框架集成，同时利用蓝牙协议进行设备交互","ja":"Wahoo KICKRなどのスマートトレーナーで阻力を制御するコンソールファーストアプローチを使用してエージェントに権限を与え、C#コンソールアプリケーションでのプロトコルロジックを強調し、WPF/MAUIなどのUIフレームワークと統合し、デバイスのやりとりにはBluetoothプロトコルを利用","ko":"Wahoo KICKR와 같은 스마트 트레이너에서 저항을 제어하는 콘솔 우선 접근 방식을 사용하여 에이전트에 권한을 부여하고 C# 콘솔 애플리케이션에서 프로토콜 논리를 강조하며 WPF/MAUI와 같은 UI 프레임워크와 통합하고 디바이스 상호 작용에는 블루투스 프로토콜을 활용","es":"Habilita a los agentes a controlar la resistencia en entrenadores inteligentes como Wahoo KICKR utilizando un enfoque de Consola Primero, enfatizando la lógica de protocolo con aplicaciones de consola C# y integrándose con frameworks de interfaz de usuario como WPF/MAUI, mientras se aprovechan los protocolos Bluetooth para la interacción con dispositivos","fr":"Permet aux agents de contrôler la résistance sur des entraîneurs intelligents comme Wahoo KICKR en utilisant une approche de Console First, en mettant l''accent sur la logique de protocole avec des applications de console C# et en s''intégrant avec des frameworks d''interface utilisateur comme WPF/MAUI, tout en exploitant les protocoles Bluetooth pour l''interaction avec les appareils","de":"Ermächtigt Agents, die Resistenz auf intelligenten Trainingsgeräten wie Wahoo KICKR mithilfe eines Console-First-Ansatzes zu kontrollieren, wobei die Protokolllogik mit C#-Konsolenanwendungen betont und in UI-Frameworks wie WPF/MAUI integriert wird, während die Bluetooth-Protokolle für die Geräteinteraktion genutzt werden","pt":"Habilita os agentes a controlar a resistência em treinadores inteligentes como o Wahoo KICKR usando uma abordagem Console First, enfatizando a lógica de protocolo com Aplicativos de Console C# e integrando com frameworks de UI como WPF/MAUI, ao mesmo tempo em que aproveita os protocolos Bluetooth para interação com dispositivos","ru":"Позволяет агентам управлять сопротивлением на умных тренажерах, таких как Wahoo KICKR, используя подход Console First, подчеркивая логiku протокола с помощью приложений C# Console и интегрируя с фреймворками UI, такими как WPF/MAUI, а также использует протоколы Bluetooth для взаимодействия с устройствами","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من التحكم في المقاومة على أجهزة التمرين الذكية مثل جهاز Wahoo KICKR باستخدام نهج Console First، مع التركيز على منطق البروتوكول باستخدام تطبيقات C# Console والدمج مع إطارات واجهة المستخدم مثل WPF/MAUI، مع الاستفادة من بروتوكولات Bluetooth للتفاعل مع الأجهزة"},"useCases":{"en":["Developing biking fitness applications with smart trainer integration","Automating workout resistance control via Bluetooth","Debugging connectivity issues with FTMS devices"],"zh":["开发集成智能训练器的骑行健身应用","通过蓝牙自动控制锻炼阻力","使用FTMS设备调试连接问题"],"ja":["スマートトレーナーを統合したサイクリングフィットネスアプリケーションの開発","Bluetoothによるワークアウト阻力制御の自動化","FTMSデバイスを使用した接続性の問題のデバッグ"],"ko":["스마트 트레이너를 통합한 자전거 피트니스 애플리케이션 개발","블루투스를 통한 운동 저항 제어 자동화","FTMS 디바이스를 사용한 연결성 문제 디버깅"],"es":["Desarrollar aplicaciones de fitness para bicicletas con integración de entrenadores inteligentes","Automatizar el control de la resistencia del entrenamiento a través de Bluetooth","Depurar problemas de conectividad con dispositivos FTMS"],"fr":["Développer des applications de fitness pour vélo avec intégration d''entraîneurs intelligents","Automatiser le contrôle de la résistance d''entraînement via Bluetooth","Déboguer les problèmes de connectivité avec les appareils FTMS"],"de":["Entwicklung von Fitness-Anwendungen für Fahrräder mit Integration intelligenter Trainingsgeräte","Automatisierung der Trainingswiderstandskontrolle über Bluetooth","Fehlerbehebung bei Konnektivitätsproblemen mit FTMS-Geräten"],"pt":["Desenvolver aplicações de fitness para bicicletas com integração de treinador inteligente","Automatizar o controle de resistência de treino via Bluetooth","Depurar problemas de conectividade com dispositivos FTMS"],"ru":["Разработка фитнес-приложений для велосипедов с интеграцией умного тренажера","Автоматизация управления сопротивлением тренировки через Bluetooth","Отладка проблем подключения к устройствам FTMS"],"ar":["تطوير تطبيقات اللياقة البدنية للدراجات الهوائية مع دمج جهاز التمرين الذكي","أتمتة التحكم في مقاومة التمرين عبر Bluetooth","تصحيح أخطاء الاتصال مع أجهزة FTMS"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Windows environment for app development","Limited to Bluetooth-enabled smart trainers","C# programming knowledge necessary"],"zh":["需要Windows环境进行应用开发","仅限蓝牙启用的智能训练器","需要C#编程知识"],"ja":["アプリ開発にはWindows環境が必要","Bluetooth対応のスマートトレーナーのみ","C#のプログラミング知識が必要"],"ko":["애플리케이션 개발을 위해 윈도우 환경이 필요","블루투스 지원 스마트 트레이너만 해당","C# 프로그래밍 지식이 필요"],"es":["Requiere un entorno de Windows para el desarrollo de aplicaciones","Limitado a entrenadores inteligentes con Bluetooth","Conocimientos de programación en C# necesarios"],"fr":["Nécessite un environnement Windows pour le développement d''applications","Limité aux entraîneurs intelligents équipés de Bluetooth","Connaissances de programmation en C# nécessaires"],"de":["Benötigt eine Windows-Umgebung für die Anwendungsentwicklung","Begrenzt auf Bluetooth-fähige intelligente Trainingsgeräte","C#-Programmierkenntnisse erforderlich"],"pt":["Requer ambiente Windows para desenvolvimento de aplicativos","Limitado a treinadores inteligentes com Bluetooth","Conhecimento de programação C# necessário"],"ru":["Требуется среда Windows для разработки приложений","Ограничен умными тренажерами с поддержкой Bluetooth","Необходимо знание программирования на C#"],"ar":["يتطلب بيئة Windows لتطوير التطبيقات","محدود بأجهزة التمرين الذكية التي تدعم Bluetooth","مطلوب معرفة لغة البرمجة C#"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"4bfc1095d32bc8882b067068702