loppeurs","38 agents pour un codage autonome","Compatibilité avec Claude Code et d''autres","Intégration avec des plugins et des hooks","Orchestration de plusieurs agents","Développement d''applications avec voix de marque"],"de":["90+ Fähigkeiten für Entwickler","38 Agenten für autonomes Coden","Kompatibilität mit Claude Code und anderen","Integration mit Plugins und Hooks","Orchestrierung von mehreren Agenten","Entwicklung von Anwendungen mit Markenstimme"],"pt":["90+ habilidades para desenvolvimento de IA","65+ comandos para automação de tarefas","Integração com Claude Code e outros plugins","Suporte a multi-agentes e orquestração","Desenvolvimento de código autônomo com Hooks"],"ru":["90+ навыков для разработки ИИ","65+ команд для автоматизации задач","Интеграция с Claude Code и другими плагинами","Поддержка.multi-агентов и оркестровки","Разработка автономного кода с помощью Hooks"],"ar":["90+ مهارات لتنمية الذكاء الاصطناعي","65+ أوامر لتأتمة المهام","التكامل مع Claude Code وبرامج附加 أخرى","دعم متعدد الوكلاء والتنسيق","تطوير رمز ذاتي مع Hooks"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI智能体","品牌声音技能","Agentic Creator OS","Claude Code","AI开发工具","如何使用Agentic Creator OS","AI智能体开发指南"],"ja":["AIエージェント","ブランドボイス","Agentic Creator OS","Claude Code","AI開発ツール","Agentic Creator OSの使い方","AIエージェント開発ガイド"],"ko":["AI 에이전트","브랜드 보이스","Agentic Creator OS","Claude Code","AI 개발 도구","Agentic Creator OS 사용법","AI 에이전트 개발 가이드"],"es":["cómo usar Agentic Creator OS","qué es la voz de marca en IA","alternativas a Claude Code","Agentic Creator OS vs otros","instalación de Agentic Creator OS","guía de configuración de Agentic Creator OS","desarrollo de aplicaciones con IA","herramientas de codificación autónoma"],"fr":["comment utiliser Agentic Creator OS","quoi est la voix de marque dans l''IA","alternatives à Claude Code","Agentic Creator OS vs autres","installation d''Agentic Creator OS","guide de configuration d''Agentic Creator OS","développement d''applications avec l''IA","outils de codage autonome"],"de":["wie man Agentic Creator OS verwendet","was ist die Markenstimme in der KI","Alternativen zu Claude Code","Agentic Creator OS vs andere","Installation von Agentic Creator OS","Einrichtungsanleitung für Agentic Creator OS","Entwicklung von Anwendungen mit KI","Tools für autonomes Coden"],"pt":["como usar Agentic Creator OS","o que é Agentic Creator OS","Agentic Creator OS vs outros sistemas operacionais","instalar Agentic Creator OS","guia de configuração do Agentic Creator OS","desenvolvimento de IA com Agentic Creator OS","automação de tarefas com Agentic Creator OS","Agentic Creator OS alternative"],"ru":["как использовать Agentic Creator OS","что такое Agentic Creator OS","Agentic Creator OS vs другие операционные системы","установить Agentic Creator OS","руководство по настройке Agentic Creator OS","разработка ИИ с Agentic Creator OS","автоматизация задач с Agentic Creator OS","Agentic Creator OS альтернатива"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام نظام Agentic Creator OS","ما هو نظام Agentic Creator OS","نظام Agentic Creator OS مقابل أنظمة تشغيل أخرى","تثبيت نظام Agentic Creator OS","دليل إعداد نظام Agentic Creator OS","تنمية الذكاء الاصطناعي بنظام Agentic Creator OS","تأتمة المهام بنظام Agentic Creator OS","بديل نظام Agentic Creator OS"]}},"owner":"frankxai","repo":"agentic-creator-os","repoPath":"frankxai/agentic-creator-os","stars":2,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-25T20:31:39Z","topics":["agentic-skills","ai-agents","autonomous-coding","claude-code","claude-code-plugins","context-engineering","developer-tools","hooks","llm","multi-agent","orchestration","skills","subagents"],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"brand-voice","description":"Apply and enforce brand voice across all content creation. Manages voice attributes, tone adaptation by channel, style rules, and terminology. Use when writing content, reviewing drafts, or defining brand voice for a new project. Loads voice config from CREATOR.md or creator-memory/voice.md.","bodyPreview":"# Brand Voice\n\nWrite in a consistent voice — not just tone, but the specific fingerprint of how a creator communicates.\n\n## Voice vs. Tone\n\n**Voice** is fixed. It''s the personality — what the brand always sounds like.\n**Tone** is variable. It''s the emotional inflection applied to the voice based on context.\n\nA creator''s voice stays consistent across channels. Tone adapts: more formal on LinkedIn, punchier on X, warmer in email.\n\n## Voice Loading\n\nBefore writing, check for voice config in this or","body":"# Brand Voice\n\nWrite in a consistent voice — not just tone, but the specific fingerprint of how a creator communicates.\n\n## Voice vs. Tone\n\n**Voice** is fixed. It''s the personality — what the brand always sounds like.\n**Tone** is variable. It''s the emotional inflection applied to the voice based on context.\n\nA creator''s voice stays consistent across channels. Tone adapts: more formal on LinkedIn, punchier on X, warmer in email.\n\n## Voice Loading\n\nBefore writing, check for voice config in this order:\n1. `CREATOR.md` — voice section (quick ref, covers 90% of cases)\n2. `creator-memory/voice.md` — full documentation with examples\n3. If neither exists: ask user to describe their voice, or offer to initialize\n\n## The 5 Voice Components\n\nA complete voice profile covers:\n\n### 1. Voice Attributes (3-5 maximum)\nEach attribute defined as:\n- **We are**: what it means in practice\n- **We are not**: the misinterpretation to avoid\n- **Sounds like**: example sentence\n- **Never sounds like**: anti-example\n\nExample for \"Cool Authority\":\n- **We are**: confident, precise, lets the work speak\n- **We are not**: arrogant, dismissive, or name-dropping\n- **Sounds like**: \"[Specific result]. Here''s what that teaches you about [topic].\"\n- **Never sounds like**: \"As a top AI architect, I know better than most that...\"\n\n### 2. Audience Definition\n- Who the primary audience is\n- What they already know (don''t over-explain)\n- What they want from this creator\n- How they expect to be addressed (peer, student, collaborator)\n\n### 3. Content Pillars\n3-5 core themes the creator consistently covers. Every piece of content should belong to one. Defined with topic focus, audience, and core argument.\n\n### 4. Tone Adaptation Rules\nHow the voice shifts by context while staying recognizably consistent.\n\n| Channel | Tone shift | Example |\n|---------|-----------|---------|\n| Long-form blog | Educational, complete, evidence-based | Full arguments, examples, conclusions |\n| LinkedIn | Professional, thought-provoking, personal | First-person insight, business framing |\n| X/Twitter | Direct, punchy, opinionated | Short sentences, bold claims |\n| Email | Personal, warm, action-oriented | \"You\" framing, clear next step |\n| Video | Conversational, energetic | Shorter sentences, visual language |\n\n### 5. Terminology Rules\nPreferred and avoided terms. Examples:\n- \"creators\" not \"influencers\"\n- \"ships\" not \"launches\" (for product releases)\n- \"AI music\" not \"generated music\"\n- Never: spiritual language, guru tone, lazy CTAs (\"drop a comment below\")\n\n## Applying Voice to Content\n\nWhen writing, run this checklist:\n1. Read the voice attributes from CREATOR.md\n2. Draft the opener — rewrite until it sounds like the creator\n3. Check for anti-patterns (things this creator never says)\n4. Verify tone matches the channel rules\n5. Check terminology — any flagged words used?\n\n**Red flags requiring revision:**\n- Opener starts with \"I\" (usually weak, unless intentional personal story)\n- More than one \"!\" in a piece\n- \"Amazing\", \"awesome\", \"incredible\" (generic, not precise)\n- \"In today''s fast-paced world...\" (stock opener, never use)\n- Passive voice where active works better\n- Hedging: \"I think\", \"maybe\", \"possibly\" (unless intentional)\n\n## Loading Voice Config\n\nCheck for voice documentation in this priority order:\n1. `CREATOR.md` in the current project (hot cache — covers 90% of requests)\n2. `creator-memory/voice.md` in the current project (full documentation)\n3. Project `CLAUDE.md` — look for a \"Brand Positioning\" or \"Voice\" section\n4. If none found: ask the user to describe their voice, or run `/creator-sprint`\n\nSee `references/voice-frameworks.md` for the full voice documentation template and attribute definition system.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-27T01:58:26.485Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Content Creation Agents needing consistent brand voice implementation across multiple channels.","zh":"非常适合需要跨多个渠道实施一致品牌声音的内容创作AI Agent。","ja":"複数のチャネルで一貫したブランドボイスを実装する必要があるコンテンツ作成エージェントに最適です。","ko":"다양한 채널에서 일관된 브랜드 보이스를 구현해야 하는 콘텐츠 제작 에이전트에 완벽합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Creación de Contenido que necesitan implementar una voz de marca consistente en varios canales.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de création de contenu nécessitant une mise en œuvre d''une voix de marque cohérente sur plusieurs canaux.","de":"Perfekt für Content-Erstellung-Agenten, die eine konsistente Markenstimme auf mehreren Kanälen umsetzen müssen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Criação de Conteúdo que necessitam de implementação de voz de marca consistente em vários canais.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов по созданию контента, которым необходима последовательная реализация брендового голоса на нескольких каналах.","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء إنشاء المحتوى الذين يحتاجون إلى تنفيذ صوت العلامة التجارية المنتظم عبر قنوات متعددة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to maintain a consistent voice, adapting tone based on context, and ensuring a unique fingerprint in communication through channels like LinkedIn, X, and email using voice configuration protocols.","zh":"使Agent能够通过voice configuration protocols，在LinkedIn、X和电子邮件等渠道中保持一致的语调，根据上下文调整语气，并确保通信具有独特的特征。","ja":"voice configuration protocolsを使用して、LinkedIn、X、メールなどのチャネルを通じて、一貫したボイスを維持し、コンテキストに基づいてトーンを適応させ、コミュニケーションに独自の特徴を確保するようにエージェントを強化します。","ko":"voice configuration protocols를 사용하여 LinkedIn, X, 이메일과 같은 채널을 통해 일관된 보이스를 유지하고, 컨텍스트에 따라 톤을 조정하며, 커뮤니케이션에 고유한 특징을 보장하도록 에이전트를 지원합니다.","es":"Empodera a los agentes para mantener una voz coherente, adaptando el tono en función del contexto y garantizando una huella única en la comunicación a través de canales como LinkedIn, X y correo electrónico utilizando protocolos de configuración de voz.","fr":"Autonomise les agents pour maintenir une voix cohérente, en adaptant le ton en fonction du contexte et en assurant une empreinte unique dans la communication via des canaux tels que LinkedIn, X et courriel en utilisant des protocoles de configuration de voix.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, eine konsistente Stimme beizubehalten, den Ton basierend auf dem Kontext anzupassen und eine einzigartige Fingerabdruck in der Kommunikation über Kanäle wie LinkedIn, X und E-Mail sicherzustellen, indem Voice-Konfigurationsprotokolle verwendet werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a manter uma voz consistente, adaptando o tom com base no contexto e garantindo uma impressão digital única na comunicação por meio de canais como LinkedIn, X e e-mail usando protocolos de configuração de voz.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью поддерживать последовательный голос, адаптируя тон на основе контекста и обеспечивая уникальный отпечаток в общении через каналы như LinkedIn, X и электронную почту с использованием протоколов конфигурации голоса.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على الحفاظ على صوت متسق، مع تعديل النبرة بناءً على السياق وضمان بصمة فريدة في التواصل عبر قنوات مثل LinkedIn و X والبريد الإلكتروني باستخدام بروتوكولات تكوين الصوت."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating brand voice consistency across social media platforms","Generating content with variable tone based on audience and context","Debugging inconsistencies in brand communication"],"zh":["跨社交媒体平台自动化品牌声音一致性","根据受众和上下文生成具有可变语调的内容","调试品牌通信中的不一致性"],"ja":["ソーシャルメディアプラットフォーム全体でのブランドボイス一貫性の自動化","オーディエンスとコンテキストに基づいて変動するトーンでコンテンツを生成","ブランドコミュニケーションにおける不一致のデバッグ"],"ko":["소셜 미디어 플랫폼 전반에 걸친 브랜드 보이스 일관성 자동화","청중과 컨텍스트에 따라 가변적인 톤의 콘텐츠 생성","브랜드 커뮤니케이션에서의 불일치 디버깅"],"es":["Automatizar la coherencia de la voz de marca en plataformas de medios sociales","Generar contenido con tono variable en función de la audiencia y el contexto","Depurar inconsistencias en la comunicación de la marca"],"fr":["Automatiser la cohérence de la voix de marque sur les plateformes de médias sociaux","Générer du contenu avec un ton variable en fonction du public et du contexte","Déboguer les incohérences dans la communication de la marque"],"de":["Automatisieren der Markenstimmen-Konsistenz auf sozialen Medien-Plattformen","Erstellen von Inhalten mit variabler Tonlage in Abhängigkeit von Publikum und Kontext","Fehlerbehebung bei Inkonsistenzen in der Markenkommunikation"],"pt":["Automatizar a consistência da voz da marca em plataformas de mídia social","Gerar conteúdo com tom variável com base no público e contexto","Depurar inconsistências na comunicação da marca"],"ru":["Автоматизировать последовательность брендового голоса на платформах социальных сетей","Генерировать контент с переменным тоном на основе аудитории и контекста","Отладить несоответствия в коммуникации бренда"],"ar":["تحسين تناسق صوت العلامة التجارية عبر منصات وسائل الإعلام الاجتماعية","генерировать المحتوى بنبرة متغيرة بناءً على الجمهور والسياق","تصحيح عدم الاتساق في اتصالات العلامة التجارية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires voice configuration setup","Contextual understanding of tone adaptation needed"],"zh":["需要voice configuration设置","需要语境理解以实现语调适应"],"ja":["voice configurationのセットアップが必要","トーン適応に関するコンテキストの理解が必要"],"ko":["voice configuration 설정이 필요함","톤 적응에 대한 컨텍스트 이해가 필요함"],"es":["Requiere configuración de voz","Se necesita comprensión contextual de la adaptación del tono"],"fr":["Nécessite une configuration de voix","Compréhension contextuelle de l''adaptation du ton nécessaire"],"de":["Benötigt Voice-Konfiguration","Kontextuelles Verständnis der Tonanpassung erforderlich"],"pt":["Requer configuração de voz","Entendimento contextual da adaptação do tom necessário"],"ru":["Требуется настройка голоса","Необходимо контекстное понимание адаптации тона"],"ar":["يتطلب إعداد صوت","يُطلب فهم سياقي لتعديل النبرة"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"cf08bbcd3544bc3968220b0a64b688a13f7196265d5a09de9d142eaa015b7874","qualityScore":23}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('hivellm/tml/artifacts', 'community', 'hivellm', 'tml', 'hivellm/tml', 'artifacts', 1, 1, 23, '2026-02-26T06:21:16Z', '2026-02-26T08:45:01.164Z', 'e460d1cdb64d0a2ded04f9bfe3fcea6a6af03c8fcdabf56f56c07d0751047aaf', '{"id":"hivellm/tml/artifacts","name":"artifacts","description":{"zh":"TML是一种专为大型语言模型设计的编程语言，提供稳定的ID和正式的契约","ja":"TMLは、大型言語モデル向けに設計されたプログラミング言語です。安定したIDと正式な契約を提供します","ko":"TML은 대형 언어 모델을 위한 프로그래밍 언어로 안정적인 ID와正式한 계약을 제공합니다","es":"TML es un lenguaje de programación diseñado para modelos de lenguaje grande, que ofrece estabilidad y determinismo","fr":"TML est un langage de programmation conçu pour les modèles de langage, qui offre de la stabilité et du déterminisme","de":"TML ist eine Programmiersprache, die speziell für Large Language Models entwickelt wurde und Stabilität sowie Determinismus bietet","pt":"TML é uma linguagem de programação projetada para Modelos de Linguagem Grande, eliminando ambiguidades e proporcionando estabilidade","ru":"TML - язык программирования для Больших Языковых Моделей, устраняющий неоднозначности и обеспечивающий стабильность","ar":"TML هي لغة برمجة مصممة للنماذج اللغوية الكبيرة، تلغي الغموض وتوفر الاستقرار","en":"TML is a programming language designed specifically for Large Language Models (LLMs). It eliminates parsing ambiguities, provides stable IDs for refactoring, and uses formal contracts to make code generation and analysis deterministic."},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"AI智能体 - TML编程语言","ja":"AIエージェント - TMLプログラミング言語","ko":"AI 에이전트 - TML 프로그래밍 언어","es":"Herramientas de IA: TML para modelos de lenguaje","fr":"Outils d''IA: TML pour les modèles de langage","de":"KI-Tools: TML für Large Language Models","pt":"Ferramentas de IA: TML para Modelos de Linguagem","ru":"ИИ Агенты: TML для Больших Языковых Моделей","ar":"أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي: TML للنماذج اللغوية الكبيرة","en":"artifacts"},"description":{"zh":"TML是一种专为大型语言模型设计的编程语言，提供稳定的ID和正式的契约","ja":"TMLは、大型言語モデル向けに設計されたプログラミング言語です。安定したIDと正式な契約を提供します","ko":"TML은 대형 언어 모델을 위한 프로그래밍 언어로 안정적인 ID와正式한 계약을 제공합니다","es":"TML es un lenguaje de programación diseñado para modelos de lenguaje grande, que ofrece estabilidad y determinismo","fr":"TML est un langage de programmation conçu pour les modèles de langage, qui offre de la stabilité et du déterminisme","de":"TML ist eine Programmiersprache, die speziell für Large Language Models entwickelt wurde und Stabilität sowie Determinismus bietet","pt":"TML é uma linguagem de programação projetada para Modelos de Linguagem Grande, eliminando ambiguidades e proporcionando estabilidade","ru":"TML - язык программирования для Больших Языковых Моделей, устраняющий неоднозначности и обеспечивающий стабильность","ar":"TML هي لغة برمجة مصممة للنماذج اللغوية الكبيرة، تلغي الغموض وتوفر الاستقرار","en":"TML is a programming language designed specifically for Large Language Models (LLMs). It eliminates parsing ambiguities, provides stable IDs for refactoring,..."},"definition":{"en":"TML is a programming language designed specifically for Large Language Models (LLMs). It eliminates parsing ambiguities, provides stable IDs for refactoring, and uses formal contracts to make code generation and analysis deterministic."},"features":{"zh":["消除解析歧义","提供稳定的ID","正式的契约","代码生成和分析"],"ja":["解析の曖昧さを排除","安定したIDを提供","正式な契約","コード生成と分析"],"ko":["구문 분석의 모호성을 제거","안정적인 ID를 제공","正式한 계약","코드 생성과 분석"],"es":["Eliminación de ambigüedades en el parsing","Estabilidad en la refactorización","Contratos formales para la generación de código","Análisis determinista","Mejora de la eficiencia en el desarrollo de modelos de lenguaje"],"fr":["Élimination des ambiguïtés dans le parsing","Stabilité dans la refactorisation","Contrats formels pour la génération de code","Analyse déterministe","Amélioration de l''efficacité dans le développement de modèles de langage"],"de":["Eliminierung von Ambiguität