''événements en temps réel"],"de":["Ereignisgesteuerte Architektur","Integration mit JavaScript und AWS","Kompatibilität mit der JSON:API-Spezifikation","Entwicklung von skalierbaren Anwendungen","Ereignisverwaltung in Echtzeit"],"pt":["Arquitetura de eventos escalável","Integração com JavaScript e AWS","Suporte ao JSON:API","Desenvolvimento de aplicações em tempo real","Melhoria da experiência do usuário"],"ru":["Масштабируемая событийная архитектура","Интеграция с JavaScript и AWS","Поддержка JSON:API","Разработка приложений в режиме реального времени","Улучшение пользовательского опыта"],"ar":["هندسة الحدث القابلة للتوسع","التكامل مع JavaScript و AWS","دعم JSON:API","تنمية التطبيقات في الوقت الفعلي","تحسين تجربة المستخدم"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI智能代理","事件驱动架构","JavaScript开发","AWS集成","JSON:API规范","如何使用AI智能代理","AI智能代理安装","AI智能代理设置指南"],"ja":["AIエージェント","イベント駆動アーキテクチャ","JavaScript開発","AWS統合","JSON:API仕様","AIエージェントの使い方","AIエージェントのインストール","AIエージェントの設定ガイド"],"ko":["AI 에이전트","이벤트 구동 아키텍처","JavaScript 개발","AWS 통합","JSON:API 사양","AI 에이전트 사용 방법","AI 에이전트 설치","AI 에이전트 설정 가이드"],"es":["cómo utilizar Ticket","qué es la arquitectura orientada a eventos","alternativas a Ticket","Ticket vs AWS Lambda","instalación de Ticket","guía de configuración de Ticket"],"fr":["comment utiliser Ticket","qu''est-ce que l''architecture orientée aux événements","alternatives à Ticket","Ticket vs AWS Lambda","installation de Ticket","guide de configuration de Ticket"],"de":["wie man Ticket verwendet","was ist die ereignisgesteuerte Architektur","Alternativen zu Ticket","Ticket vs AWS Lambda","Installation von Ticket","Einrichtungsanleitung für Ticket"],"pt":["ferramentas de ia","arquitetura de eventos","javascript","aws","json:api","desenvolvimento de aplicações","aplicações em tempo real","experiência do usuário","como usar ferramentas de ia","o que é arquitetura de eventos"],"ru":["ии агенты","событийная архитектура","javascript","aws","json:api","разработка приложений","приложения в режиме реального времени","пользовательский опыт","как использовать ии агенты","что такое событийная архитектура"],"ar":["أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","هندسة الحدث","javascript","aws","json:api","تنمية التطبيقات","تطبيقات في الوقت الفعلي","تجربة المستخدم","كيفية استخدام أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","ما هي هندسة الحدث"]}},"owner":"finlaysonstudio","repo":"jaypie","repoPath":"finlaysonstudio/jaypie","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:10.936Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"ticket","description":"Work a GitHub issue -- validate, test, plan, implement, report","bodyPreview":"# Ticket\n\nWork a GitHub issue end-to-end.\n\n1. **Fetch** the issue using GitHub MCP\n2. **Validate** it''s not already fixed or invalid\n3. **Test** write a failing test to confirm the report (discuss limitations if not possible)\n4. **Plan** investigate and propose before implementing (skip if operator says \"just fix it\"); suggest a better approach if the issue seems misguided\n5. **Branch** _only if starting from main_ `fix/issue-NNN` or `feat/issue-NNN`. If the working branch is not main, continue","body":"# Ticket\n\nWork a GitHub issue end-to-end.\n\n1. **Fetch** the issue using GitHub MCP\n2. **Validate** it''s not already fixed or invalid\n3. **Test** write a failing test to confirm the report (discuss limitations if not possible)\n4. **Plan** investigate and propose before implementing (skip if operator says \"just fix it\"); suggest a better approach if the issue seems misguided\n5. **Branch** _only if starting from main_ `fix/issue-NNN` or `feat/issue-NNN`. If the working branch is not main, continue without creating a new branch\n6. **Implement** and verify\n7. **Report** results, propose running `/prepare` unless directed to run prepare\n8. If the user says \"shepherd\" they want `/prepare` and `/shepherd` run\n\nDo not commit or push unless told.\n\n## User Input\n\n<input>\n$ARGUMENTS\n</input>\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T02:34:53.077Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Development Agents needing end-to-end GitHub issue management capabilities.","zh":"Perfect for Development Agents needing end-to-end GitHub issue management capabilities.","ja":"Perfect for Development Agents needing end-to-end GitHub issue management capabilities.","ko":"Perfect for Development Agents needing end-to-end GitHub issue management capabilities.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de desarrollo que necesitan capacidades de administración de problemas de GitHub de extremo a extremo.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développement ayant besoin de capacités de gestion de problèmes GitHub de bout en bout.","de":"Perfekt für Entwicklungsmittel, die eine umfassende GitHub-Issue-Verwaltung benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvimento que necessitam de capacidades de gerenciamento de problemas do GitHub de ponta a ponta.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов разработки, которым необходимы возможности управления проблемами GitHub от начала до конца.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء النموزجيين الذين يحتاجون إلى إمكانيات إدارة قضايا GitHub من النهاية إلى النهاية."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to work GitHub issues end-to-end, from fetching and validating issues to testing, planning, and branching, using JavaScript, AWS, and the JSON:API specification.","zh":"Empowers agents to work GitHub issues end-to-end, from fetching and validating issues to testing, planning, and branching, using JavaScript, AWS, and the JSON:API specification.","ja":"Empowers agents to work GitHub issues end-to-end, from fetching and validating issues to testing, planning, and branching, using JavaScript, AWS, and the JSON:API specification.","ko":"Empowers agents to work GitHub issues end-to-end, from fetching and validating issues to testing, planning, and branching, using JavaScript, AWS, and the JSON:API specification.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a trabajar con los problemas de GitHub de extremo a extremo, desde la recuperación y validación de problemas hasta las pruebas, la planificación y la ramificación, utilizando JavaScript, AWS y la especificación JSON:API.","fr":"Permet aux agents de travailler sur les problèmes GitHub de bout en bout, de la récupération et de la validation des problèmes aux tests, à la planification et au branching, en utilisant JavaScript, AWS et la spécification JSON:API.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, GitHub-Probleme von Ende zu Ende zu bearbeiten, von der Abrufung und Validierung von Problemen bis zum Testen, Planen und Branching, unter Verwendung von JavaScript, AWS und der JSON:API-Spezifikation.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a trabalhar com problemas do GitHub de ponta a ponta, desde buscar e validar problemas até testar, planejar e criar branches, usando JavaScript, AWS e a especificação JSON:API.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью работать с проблемами GitHub от начала до конца, начиная от извлечения и проверки проблем и заканчивая тестированием, планированием и созданием веток, используя JavaScript, AWS и спецификацию JSON:API.","ar":"يمكّن الوكلاء من العمل على قضايا GitHub من النهاية إلى النهاية، بدءًا من استرجاع واعتماد القضايا وانتهاءً بالاختبار والتخطيط وإنشاء الفروع، باستخدام JavaScript وAWS ومواصفات JSON:API."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating issue triage and validation","Generating failing tests for reported issues","Debugging and planning fixes for complex issues"],"zh":["Automating issue triage and validation","Generating failing tests for reported issues","Debugging and planning fixes for complex issues"],"ja":["Automating issue triage and validation","Generating failing tests for reported issues","Debugging and planning fixes for complex issues"],"ko":["Automating issue triage and validation","Generating failing tests for reported issues","Debugging and planning fixes for complex issues"],"es":["Automatización de la clasificación y validación de problemas","Generación de pruebas fallidas para problemas informados","Depuración y planificación de soluciones para problemas complejos"],"fr":["Automatisation de la triage et de la validation des problèmes","Génération de tests échoués pour les problèmes signalés","Débogage et planification de correctifs pour les problèmes complexes"],"de":["Automatisierung der Problemtriage und -validierung","Erzeugung fehlgeschlagener Tests für gemeldete Probleme","Fehlersuche und Planung von Korrekturen für komplexe Probleme"],"pt":["Automatizar a triagem e validação de problemas","Gerar testes com falhas para problemas relatados","Depurar e planejar soluções para problemas complexos"],"ru":["Автоматизировать сортировку и проверку проблем","Генерировать неудачные тесты для сообщенных проблем","Отлаживать и планировать исправления для сложных проблем"],"ar":["أتمتة فحص القضايا وتأكيدها","إنتاج اختبارات فاشلة لقضايا تم الإبلاغ عنها","تصحيح الأخطاء وتخطيط إصلاحات لقضايا معقدة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires GitHub MCP and JSON:API specification compliance","Limited to JavaScript and AWS ecosystems"],"zh":["Requires GitHub MCP and JSON:API specification compliance","Limited to JavaScript and AWS ecosystems"],"ja":["Requires GitHub MCP and JSON:API specification compliance","Limited to JavaScript and AWS ecosystems"],"ko":["Requires GitHub MCP and JSON:API specification compliance","Limited to JavaScript and AWS ecosystems"],"es":["Requiere cumplimiento de GitHub MCP y la especificación JSON:API","Limitado a los ecosistemas JavaScript y AWS"],"fr":["Nécessite la conformité à GitHub MCP et à la spécification JSON:API","Limité aux écosystèmes JavaScript et AWS"],"de":["Benötigt die Einhaltung von GitHub MCP und der JSON:API-Spezifikation","Begrenzt auf die JavaScript- und AWS-Ökosysteme"],"pt":["Exige conformidade com o GitHub MCP e a especificação JSON:API","Limitado aos ecossistemas JavaScript e AWS"],"ru":["Требует соблюдения GitHub MCP и спецификации JSON:API","Ограничен экосистемами JavaScript и AWS"],"ar":["يتطلب التزامًا بمواصفات GitHub MCP ومواصفات JSON:API","محدود بنطاقي JavaScript وAWS"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"90a468e093ab51ce17f05bf6ac1298d29827fab56f5d3e28ec5305710ecdcb17","qualityScore":23}');
