pubsub","guide de configuration de monolith-websocket-pubsub"],"de":["wie man monolith-websocket-pubsub verwendet","was ist monolith-websocket-pubsub","alternativen zu monolith-websocket-pubsub","monolith-websocket-pubsub vs Rails","installation von monolith-websocket-pubsub","konfigurationsanleitung für monolith-websocket-pubsub"],"pt":["como usar monolith-websocket-pubsub","o que é monolith-websocket-pubsub","monolith-websocket-pubsub alternativa","monolith-websocket-pubsub vs rails","instalar monolith-websocket-pubsub","guia de configuração monolith-websocket-pubsub"],"ru":["как использовать monolith-websocket-pubsub","что такое monolith-websocket-pubsub","альтернатива monolith-websocket-pubsub","monolith-websocket-pubsub vs rails","установить monolith-websocket-pubsub","руководство по настройке monolith-websocket-pubsub"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام monolith-websocket-pubsub","ما هو monolith-websocket-pubsub","بديل monolith-websocket-pubsub","monolith-websocket-pubsub مقابل ريلز","تثبيت monolith-websocket-pubsub","دليل إعداد monolith-websocket-pubsub"]}},"owner":"cggonzal","repo":"monolith","repoPath":"cggonzal/monolith","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:11.099Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"monolith-websocket-pubsub","description":"Use when implementing real-time functionality using the built-in websocket pub/sub layer (`/ws`), including subscribe/message protocol and channel design.","bodyPreview":"# Monolith WebSocket Pub/Sub\n\n## Use this skill when\n- Building chat/live updates.\n- Debugging channel subscriptions or message broadcast behavior.\n\n## Entry points\n- Route: `GET /ws` in `app/routes/routes.go`\n- Implementation: `ws/ws.go`\n- Persistent message model: `app/models/ws.go`\n\n## Client protocol\nSend JSON commands:\n- Subscribe: `{\"command\":\"subscribe\",\"identifier\":\"ChatChannel\"}`\n- Publish: `{\"command\":\"message\",\"identifier\":\"ChatChannel\",\"data\":\"Hello\"}`\n\n## Server behavior\n- Hub track","body":"# Monolith WebSocket Pub/Sub\n\n## Use this skill when\n- Building chat/live updates.\n- Debugging channel subscriptions or message broadcast behavior.\n\n## Entry points\n- Route: `GET /ws` in `app/routes/routes.go`\n- Implementation: `ws/ws.go`\n- Persistent message model: `app/models/ws.go`\n\n## Client protocol\nSend JSON commands:\n- Subscribe: `{\"command\":\"subscribe\",\"identifier\":\"ChatChannel\"}`\n- Publish: `{\"command\":\"message\",\"identifier\":\"ChatChannel\",\"data\":\"Hello\"}`\n\n## Server behavior\n- Hub tracks channel subscriptions.\n- `message` commands are persisted then broadcast to subscribed clients.\n- Client loop handles register/unregister and ping/pong lifecycle.\n\n## Extension workflow\n1. Pick channel naming strategy (room, user, domain event).\n2. Add frontend websocket client logic in `static/js/application.js` or app-specific JS.\n3. Optionally enforce auth checks before allowing subscribe/publish.\n4. Add tests in `ws/ws_test.go` style for command handling.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T03:33:27.717Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Real-time Update Agents requiring efficient WebSocket-based pub/sub functionality in Go","zh":"适用于需要在Go中实现高效的基于WebSocket的pub/sub功能的实时更新代理","ja":"Goで効率的なWebSocketベースのpub/sub機能を必要とするリアルタイム更新エージェントに適している","ko":"Go에서 효율적인 WebSocket 기반 pub/sub 기능을 필요로 하는 실시간 업데이트 에이전트에 적합함","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Actualización en Tiempo Real que requieren funcionalidad de pub/sub basada en WebSocket eficiente en Go","fr":"Idéal pour les Agents de Mise à Jour en Temps Réel nécessitant une fonctionnalité de pub/sub basée sur WebSocket efficace en Go","de":"Ideal für Echtzeit-Update-Agents, die eine effiziente WebSocket-basierte Pub/Sub-Funktionalität in Go erfordern","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Atualização em Tempo Real que exigem funcionalidade de pub/sub baseada em WebSocket eficiente em Go","ru":"Идеально для агентов обновления в реальном времени, требующих эффективной функциональности pub/sub на основе WebSocket в Go","ar":"مثالية للوكلاء التحديث في الوقت الفعلي الذين يتطلبون وظيفة pub/sub القائمة على WebSocket بكفاءة في Go"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to establish bi-directional communication using WebSockets, enabling real-time updates and live messaging via JSON commands, with built-in support for code generation, authentication, and ORM using gorm","zh":"赋予代理建立双向通信的能力，使用WebSockets实现实时更新和实时消息传递，通过JSON命令，并内置代码生成、认证和使用gorm的ORM支持","ja":"エージェントに双方向の通信を確立する能力を与え、WebSocketsを使用してリアルタイム更新とリアルタイムメッセージングを実現し、JSONコマンドを使用し、コード生成、認証、およびgormを使用したORMサポートを内蔵する","ko":"에이전트에 양방향 통신을 설정할 수 있는 능력을 부여하며, WebSockets를 사용하여 실시간 업데이트와 실시간 메시징을 구현하며, JSON 명령을 사용하며, 코드 생성, 인증, gorm을 사용한 ORM 지원을 내장한다","es":"Habilita a los agentes a establecer una comunicación bidireccional utilizando WebSockets, permitiendo actualizaciones en tiempo real y mensajería en vivo a través de comandos JSON, con soporte integrado para generación de código, autenticación y ORM utilizando gorm","fr":"Permet aux agents d''établir une communication bidirectionnelle en utilisant les WebSockets, permettant des mises à jour en temps réel et un messagerie en direct via des commandes JSON, avec un support intégré pour la génération de code, l''authentification et l''ORM en utilisant gorm","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, eine bidirektionale Kommunikation über WebSockets herzustellen, ermöglicht Echtzeit-Updates und Live-Nachrichten über JSON-Befehle, mit integrierter Unterstützung für Codegenerierung, Authentifizierung und ORM unter Verwendung von gorm","pt":"Habilita os agentes a estabelecer uma comunicação bidirecional usando WebSockets, permitindo atualizações em tempo real e mensagens ao vivo via comandos JSON, com suporte integrado para geração de código, autenticação e ORM usando gorm","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью устанавливать двустороннюю связь с помощью WebSockets, позволяя получать обновления в реальном времени и живую рассылку сообщений через JSON-команды, с встроенной поддержкой г